    'devotional',
    '[{"day":1,"title_en":"Proverbs 1","title_af":"Spreuke 1","passages":[{"book_id":20,"chapter":1}],"commentary_intro_en":"Today you read one chapter of Proverbs. Study each section below, then look for one practical principle to live out.","commentary_intro_af":"Vandag lees jy een hoofstuk van Spreuke. Bestudeer elke afdeling hieronder, soek dan een praktiese beginsel om uit te leef.","commentary_sections":[{"book_id":20,"chapter":1,"heading_en":"Proverbs 1","heading_af":"Spreuke 1","summary_en":"Purpose of Proverbs: wisdom, discipline, and fear of the Lord. Read Proverbs 1 yourself and verify each statement against the verses in your Bible version.","summary_af":"Doel van Spreuke: wysheid, dissipline en vrees vir die Here. Lees Spreuke 1 self en kontroleer elke stelling teen die verse in jou Bybelweergawe.","study_points_en":[{"title":"Practical wisdom for daily choices","verses":"","detail":"The text of Proverbs 1 records or illustrates: Practical wisdom for daily choices. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."},{"title":"Fear of the Lord as foundation","verses":"","detail":"The text of Proverbs 1 records or illustrates: Fear of the Lord as foundation. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."},{"title":"One principle to practice today","verses":"","detail":"The text of Proverbs 1 records or illustrates: One principle to practice today. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."}],"study_points_af":[{"title":"Praktiese wysheid vir daaglikse keuses","verses":"","detail":"Die teks van Spreuke 1 noem of illustreer: Praktiese wysheid vir daaglikse keuses. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie."},{"title":"Vrees vir die Here as fondament","verses":"","detail":"Die teks van Spreuke 1 noem of illustreer: Vrees vir die Here as fondament. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie."},{"title":"Een beginsel om vandag te oefen","verses":"","detail":"Die teks van Spreuke 1 noem of illustreer: Een beginsel om vandag te oefen. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie."}],"teaching_en":"God wants us to know that true wisdom begins with reverence for him and shapes daily choices, speech, and worship.","teaching_why_en":"Wisdom passages tie understanding to the fear of the Lord and practical living. Notice commands, prayers, or counsel in this chapter and what attitude toward God they assume.","teaching_af":"God wil hê ons moet weet dat ware wysheid begin met eerbied vir Hom en daaglikse keuses, spraak en aanbidding vorm.","teaching_why_af":"Wysheid verbind insig met die vrees vir die Here. Let op gebooie, gebede of raad in hierdie hoofstuk en watter houding teenoor God dit veronderstel.","cross_references_en":[{"ref":"Proverbs 1:7","comparison":"Wisdom books often repeat the theme that the fear of the Lord is the beginning of wisdom (Proverbs 1:7). Compare how each psalm or proverb applies that foundation differently."}],"cross_references_af":[{"ref":"Spreuke 1:7","comparison":"Wysheidsboeke herhaal dat die vrees vir die Here die begin van wysheid is (Spr 1:7). Vergelyk hoe elke psalm of spreuk dit toepas."}],"highlights_en":["Practical wisdom for daily choices","Fear of the Lord as foundation","One principle to practice today"],"highlights_af":["Praktiese wysheid vir daaglikse keuses","Vrees vir die Here as fondament","Een beginsel om vandag te oefen"]}],"commentary_en":"Today you read one chapter of Proverbs. Study each section below, then look for one practical principle to live out.\n\nProverbs 1\nPurpose of Proverbs: wisdom, discipline, and fear of the Lord. Read Proverbs 1 yourself and verify each statement against the verses in your Bible version.\n\nPractical wisdom for daily choices\nThe text of Proverbs 1 records or illustrates: Practical wisdom for daily choices. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states.\n\nFear of the Lord as foundation\nThe text of Proverbs 1 records or illustrates: Fear of the Lord as foundation. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states.\n\nOne principle to practice today\nThe text of Proverbs 1 records or illustrates: One principle to practice today. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states.\n\nWhat God wants us to know:\nGod wants us to know that true wisdom begins with reverence for him and shapes daily choices, speech, and worship.\n\nWhy:\nWisdom passages tie understanding to the fear of the Lord and practical living. Notice commands, prayers, or counsel in this chapter and what attitude toward God they assume.\n\nSimilar elsewhere:\nProverbs 1:7: Wisdom books often repeat the theme that the fear of the Lord is the beginning of wisdom (Proverbs 1:7). Compare how each psalm or proverb applies that foundation differently.","commentary_af":"Vandag lees jy een hoofstuk van Spreuke. Bestudeer elke afdeling hieronder, soek dan een praktiese beginsel om uit te leef.\n\nSpreuke 1\nDoel van Spreuke: wysheid, dissipline en vrees vir die Here. Lees Spreuke 1 self en kontroleer elke stelling teen die verse in jou Bybelweergawe.\n\nPraktiese wysheid vir daaglikse keuses\nDie teks van Spreuke 1 noem of illustreer: Praktiese wysheid vir daaglikse keuses. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie.\n\nVrees vir die Here as fondament\nDie teks van Spreuke 1 noem of illustreer: Vrees vir die Here as fondament. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie.\n\nEen beginsel om vandag te oefen\nDie teks van Spreuke 1 noem of illustreer: Een beginsel om vandag te oefen. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie.\n\nWhat God wants us to know:\nGod wil hê ons moet weet dat ware wysheid begin met eerbied vir Hom en daaglikse keuses, spraak en aanbidding vorm.\n\nWhy:\nWysheid verbind insig met die vrees vir die Here. Let op gebooie, gebede of raad in hierdie hoofstuk en watter houding teenoor God dit veronderstel.\n\nSimilar elsewhere:\nSpreuke 1:7: Wysheidsboeke herhaal dat die vrees vir die Here die begin van wysheid is (Spr 1:7). Vergelyk hoe elke psalm of spreuk dit toepas.","questions_en":["What does this passage reveal about God?","What promise, command, or truth stands out to you?","How can you apply this to your life today?"],"questions_af":["Wat openbaar hierdie gedeelte oor God?","Watter belofte, gebod of waarheid val vir jou op?","Hoe kan jy dit vandag in jou lewe toepas?"]},{"day":2,"title_en":"Proverbs 2","title_af":"Spreuke 2","passages":[{"book_id":20,"chapter":2}],"commentary_intro_en":"Today you read one chapter of Proverbs. Study each section below, then look for one practical principle to live out.","commentary_intro_af":"Vandag lees jy een hoofstuk van Spreuke. Bestudeer elke afdeling hieronder, soek dan een praktiese beginsel om uit te leef.","commentary_sections":[{"book_id":20,"chapter":2,"heading_en":"Proverbs 2","heading_af":"Spreuke 2","summary_en":"Seek wisdom like treasure; moral protection from evil paths. Read Proverbs 2 yourself and verify each statement against the verses in your Bible version.","summary_af":"Soek wysheid soos skat; morele beskerming van bose paaie. Lees Spreuke 2 self en kontroleer elke stelling teen die verse in jou Bybelweergawe.","study_points_en":[{"title":"Practical wisdom for daily choices","verses":"","detail":"The text of Proverbs 2 records or illustrates: Practical wisdom for daily choices. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."},{"title":"Fear of the Lord as foundation","verses":"","detail":"The text of Proverbs 2 records or illustrates: Fear of the Lord as foundation. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."},{"title":"One principle to practice today","verses":"","detail":"The text of Proverbs 2 records or illustrates: One principle to practice today. Re-read those verses and note exactly