ect voor hierdie hoofstuk kom — let op wat voortgaan of verander.\nSpreuke 1:7: Wysheidsboeke herhaal dat die vrees vir die Here die begin van wysheid is (Spr 1:7). Vergelyk hoe elke psalm of spreuk dit toepas.","questions_en":["What does this passage reveal about God?","What promise, command, or truth stands out to you?","How can you apply this to your life today?"],"questions_af":["Wat openbaar hierdie gedeelte oor God?","Watter belofte, gebod of waarheid val vir jou op?","Hoe kan jy dit vandag in jou lewe toepas?"]},{"day":25,"title_en":"Proverbs 25","title_af":"Spreuke 25","passages":[{"book_id":20,"chapter":25}],"commentary_intro_en":"Today you read one chapter of Proverbs. Study each section below, then look for one practical principle to live out.","commentary_intro_af":"Vandag lees jy een hoofstuk van Spreuke. Bestudeer elke afdeling hieronder, soek dan een praktiese beginsel om uit te leef.","commentary_sections":[{"book_id":20,"chapter":25,"heading_en":"Proverbs 25","heading_af":"Spreuke 25","summary_en":"Do not boast about tomorrow; faithful wounds of a friend. Read Proverbs 25 yourself and verify each statement against the verses in your Bible version.","summary_af":"Moenie roem oor môre; getroue wonde van ''n vriend. Lees Spreuke 25 self en kontroleer elke stelling teen die verse in jou Bybelweergawe.","study_points_en":[{"title":"Practical wisdom for daily choices","verses":"","detail":"The text of Proverbs 25 records or illustrates: Practical wisdom for daily choices. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."},{"title":"Fear of the Lord as foundation","verses":"","detail":"The text of Proverbs 25 records or illustrates: Fear of the Lord as foundation. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."},{"title":"One principle to practice today","verses":"","detail":"The text of Proverbs 25 records or illustrates: One principle to practice today. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."}],"study_point