hat God wants us to know:\nGod wil hê ons moet weet dat ware wysheid begin met eerbied vir Hom en daaglikse keuses, spraak en aanbidding vorm.\n\nWhy:\nWysheid verbind insig met die vrees vir die Here. Let op gebooie, gebede of raad in hierdie hoofstuk en watter houding teenoor God dit veronderstel.\n\nSimilar elsewhere:\nPsalms 74: Compare with Psalms 74, wat direct voor hierdie hoofstuk kom — let op wat voortgaan of verander.\nSpreuke 1:7: Wysheidsboeke herhaal dat die vrees vir die Here die begin van wysheid is (Spr 1:7). Vergelyk hoe elke psalm of spreuk dit toepas.","questions_en":["What does this passage reveal about God?","What promise, command, or truth stands out to you?","How can you apply this to your life today?"],"questions_af":["Wat openbaar hierdie gedeelte oor God?","Watter belofte, gebod of waarheid val vir jou op?","Hoe kan jy dit vandag in jou lewe toepas?"]},{"day":16,"title_en":"Psalms 76–80","title_af":"Psalms 76–80","passages":[{"book_id":19,"chapter":76},{"book_id":19,"chapter":77},{"book_id":19,"chapter":78},{"book_id":19,"chapter":79},{"book_id":19,"chapter":80}],"commentary_intro_en":"These psalms cover a range of human experience before God. Use the chapter summaries as a guide for prayer and reflection.","commentary_intro_af":"Hierdie psalms dek ''n reeks menslike ervaring voor God. Gebruik die hoofstuk-opsommings as gids vir gebed en refleksie.","commentary_sections":[{"book_id":19,"chapter":76,"heading_en":"Psalms 76","heading_af":"Psalms 76","summary_en":"Psalm 76 expresses worship, lament, or wisdom before God. Read it as prayer — many psalms foreshadow Christ and speak to every season of the soul. Read Psalms 76 yourself and verify each statement against the verses in your Bible version.","summary_af":"Psalm 76 druk aanbidding, klagte of wysheid voor God uit. Lees dit as gebed — baie psalms wys na Christus en spreek tot elke seisoen van die siel. Lees Psalms 76 self en kontroleer elke stelling teen die verse in jou Bybelweergawe.","