tness. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states.\n\nGrowing community\nThe text of Acts 24 records or illustrates: Growing community. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states.\n\nWhat God wants us to know:\nGod wants us to know that the risen Christ continues his work through the Spirit, the apostles, and the growing church.\n\nWhy:\nActs records preaching, conversions, miracles, and persecution. Notice how the Spirit empowers witness and how the church responds in this chapter.\n\nSimilar elsewhere:\nBook 44 23: Compare with Book 44 23, which immediately precedes this chapter in the same book — notice what events or themes continue or change.\n\nActs 25\nActs 25. The Spirit-empowered spread of the Gospel. Notice courage, community life, prayer, and how the church responds to persecution. Read Acts 25 yourself and verify each statement against the verses in your Bible version.\n\nHoly Spirit''s power\nThe text of Acts 25 records or illustrates: Holy Spirit''s power. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states.\n\nBold witness\nThe text of Acts 25 records or illustrates: Bold witness. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states.\n\nGrowing community\nThe text of Acts 25 records or illustrates: Growing community. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states.\n\nWhat God wants us to know:\nGod wants us to know that the risen Christ continues his work through the Spirit, the apostles, and the growing church.\n\nWhy:\nActs records preaching, conversions, miracles, and persecution. Notice how the Spirit empowers witness and how the church responds in this chapter.\n\nSimilar elsewhere:\nBook 44 24: Compare with Book 44 24, which immediately precedes this chapter in the same book — notice what events or themes continue or change.","commentary_af":"Nuwe Testament leeswerk vir vandag. Elke afdeling som ''n hoofstuk op sodat jy die vloei van die teks kan volg.\n\nHandeling 23\nHandeling 23. Die Gees-bemagtigde verspreiding van die Evangelie. Let op moed, gemeenskaplewe, gebed en hoe die kerk op vervolging reageer. Lees Handeling 23 self en kontroleer elke stelling teen die verse in jou Bybelweergawe.\n\nHeilige Gees se krag\nDie teks van Handeling 23 noem of illustreer: Heilige Gees se krag. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie.\n\nDapper getuienis\nDie teks van Handeling 23 noem of illustreer: Dapper getuienis. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie.\n\nGroeiende gemeenskap\nDie teks van Handeling 23 noem of illustreer: Groeiende gemeenskap. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie.\n\nWhat God wants us to know:\nGod wil hê ons moet weet dat die opgestane Christus voortwerk deur die Gees, die apostels en die groeiende kerk.\n\nWhy:\nHandeling beskryf preek, bekering, wonderwerke en vervolging. Let hoe die Gees getuienis bemagtig en hoe die kerk reageer.\n\nSimilar elsewhere:\nBook 44 22: Compare with Book 44 22, wat direct voor hierdie hoofstuk kom — let op wat voortgaan of verander.\n\nHandeling 24\nHandeling 24. Die Gees-bemagtigde verspreiding van die Evangelie. Let op moed, gemeenskaplewe, gebed en hoe die kerk op vervolging reageer. Lees Handeling 24 self en kontroleer elke stelling teen die verse in jou Bybelweergawe.\n\nHeilige Gees se krag\nDie teks van Handeling 24 noem of illustreer: Heilige Gees se krag. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie.\n\nDapper getuienis\nDie teks van Handeling 24 noem of illustreer: Dapper getuienis. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie.\n\nGroeiende gemeenskap\nDie teks van Handeling 24 noem of illustreer: Groeiende gemeenskap. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie.\n\nWhat God wants us to know:\nGod wil hê ons moet weet dat die opgestane Christus voor