 leerstelling in hierdie hoofstuk en die lewe wat dit verbind.","questions_en":["What does this passage reveal about God?","What promise, command, or truth stands out to you?","How can you apply this to your life today?"],"questions_af":["Wat openbaar hierdie gedeelte oor God?","Watter belofte, gebod of waarheid val vir jou op?","Hoe kan jy dit vandag in jou lewe toepas?"]},{"day":68,"title_en":"Titus 2 – Philemon 1","title_af":"Titus 2 – Filemon 1","passages":[{"book_id":56,"chapter":2},{"book_id":56,"chapter":3},{"book_id":57,"chapter":1}],"commentary_intro_en":"New Testament reading for today. Each section summarizes a chapter so you can follow the flow of the text.","commentary_intro_af":"Nuwe Testament leeswerk vir vandag. Elke afdeling som ''n hoofstuk op sodat jy die vloei van die teks kan volg.","commentary_sections":[{"book_id":56,"chapter":2,"heading_en":"Book 56 2","heading_af":"Boek 56 2","summary_en":"Book 56 2. Paul teaches doctrine and Christian living. Connect theological truth to practical obedience in church, family, and daily relationships. Read Book 56 2 yourself and verify each statement against the verses in your Bible version.","summary_af":"Boek 56 2. Paulus leer leerstelling en Christelike lewe. Verbind teologiese waarheid met praktiese gehoorsaamheid in kerk, gesin en daaglikse verhoudings. Lees Boek 56 2 self en kontroleer elke stelling teen die verse in jou Bybelweergawe.","study_points_en":[{"title":"Gospel truth","verses":"","detail":"The text of Book 56 2 records or illustrates: Gospel truth. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."},{"title":"Life in the Spirit","verses":"","detail":"The text of Book 56 2 records or illustrates: Life in the Spirit. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."},{"title":"Practical ethics","verses":"","detail":"The text of Book 56 2 records or illustrates: Practical ethics. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."}],"study_points_af":[{"title":"