od, seën en vloek, voor Israel.","questions_en":["What does this passage reveal about God?","What promise, command, or truth stands out to you?","How can you apply this to your life today?"],"questions_af":["Wat openbaar hierdie gedeelte oor God?","Watter belofte, gebod of waarheid val vir jou op?","Hoe kan jy dit vandag in jou lewe toepas?"]},{"day":8,"title_en":"Genesis 29–32","title_af":"Genesis 29–32","passages":[{"book_id":1,"chapter":29},{"book_id":1,"chapter":30},{"book_id":1,"chapter":31},{"book_id":1,"chapter":32}],"commentary_intro_en":"You are reading through the whole Bible. Each chapter summary below helps you grasp the main story before you read the verses.","commentary_intro_af":"Jy lees deur die hele Bybel. Elke hoofstuk-opsomming hieronder help jou die hoofverhaal te begryp voordat jy die verse lees.","commentary_sections":[{"book_id":1,"chapter":29,"heading_en":"Genesis 29","heading_af":"Genesis 29","summary_en":"Jacob serves Laban; Leah and Rachel; rivalry and children born. Read Genesis 29 yourself and verify each statement against the verses in your Bible version.","summary_af":"Jakob dien Laban; Lea en Rachel; rivaliteit en kinders gebore. Lees Genesis 29 self en kontroleer elke stelling teen die verse in jou Bybelweergawe.","study_points_en":[{"title":"Key events in God''s covenant story","verses":"","detail":"The text of Genesis 29 records or illustrates: Key events in God''s covenant story. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."},{"title":"Watch how promises survive human failure","verses":"","detail":"The text of Genesis 29 records or illustrates: Watch how promises survive human failure. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."},{"title":"Note worship, obedience, and grace","verses":"","detail":"The text of Genesis 29 records or illustrates: Note worship, obedience, and grace. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."}],"study_points_af":[{"title":"Sleutelgebeure in God se ver