hoofstuk kom — let op wat voortgaan of verander.\nDeuteronomium 30:15–20: Soos ander Pentateug-hoofstukke vorm hierdie teks deel van Moses se verbondsinstruksie. Deut 30 stel lewe en dood, seën en vloek, voor Israel.","questions_en":["What does this passage reveal about God?","What promise, command, or truth stands out to you?","How can you apply this to your life today?"],"questions_af":["Wat openbaar hierdie gedeelte oor God?","Watter belofte, gebod of waarheid val vir jou op?","Hoe kan jy dit vandag in jou lewe toepas?"]},{"day":14,"title_en":"Exodus 3–6","title_af":"Eksodus 3–6","passages":[{"book_id":2,"chapter":3},{"book_id":2,"chapter":4},{"book_id":2,"chapter":5},{"book_id":2,"chapter":6}],"commentary_intro_en":"You are reading through the whole Bible. Each chapter summary below helps you grasp the main story before you read the verses.","commentary_intro_af":"Jy lees deur die hele Bybel. Elke hoofstuk-opsomming hieronder help jou die hoofverhaal te begryp voordat jy die verse lees.","commentary_sections":[{"book_id":2,"chapter":3,"heading_en":"Exodus 3","heading_af":"Eksodus 3","summary_en":"Exodus 3. This chapter advances the story of God''s covenant people — watch for promises, obedience, and how God keeps His word despite human failure. Read Exodus 3 yourself and verify each statement against the verses in your Bible version.","summary_af":"Eksodus 3. Hierdie hoofstuk beweeg die verhaal van God se verbondsvolk vorentoe — let op beloftes, gehoorsaamheid en hoe God Sy woord hou ondanks menslike mislukking. Lees Eksodus 3 self en kontroleer elke stelling teen die verse in jou Bybelweergawe.","study_points_en":[{"title":"Covenant promises","verses":"","detail":"The text of Exodus 3 records or illustrates: Covenant promises. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."},{"title":"Obedience and consequences","verses":"","detail":"The text of Exodus 3 records or illustrates: Obedience and consequences. Re-read those verses and note exactly what