rtgaan of verander.","questions_en":["What does this passage reveal about God?","What promise, command, or truth stands out to you?","How can you apply this to your life today?"],"questions_af":["Wat openbaar hierdie gedeelte oor God?","Watter belofte, gebod of waarheid val vir jou op?","Hoe kan jy dit vandag in jou lewe toepas?"]},{"day":114,"title_en":"Esther 8–10","title_af":"Ester 8–10","passages":[{"book_id":17,"chapter":8},{"book_id":17,"chapter":9},{"book_id":17,"chapter":10}],"commentary_intro_en":"You are reading through the whole Bible. Each chapter summary below helps you grasp the main story before you read the verses.","commentary_intro_af":"Jy lees deur die hele Bybel. Elke hoofstuk-opsomming hieronder help jou die hoofverhaal te begryp voordat jy die verse lees.","commentary_sections":[{"book_id":17,"chapter":8,"heading_en":"Book 17 8","heading_af":"Boek 17 8","summary_en":"Book 17 8. Historical narrative showing God''s guidance through victory, failure, and restoration. Notice leadership, prayer, and the consequences of turning from God. Read Book 17 8 yourself and verify each statement against the verses in your Bible version.","summary_af":"Boek 17 8. Geskiedenisverhaal wat God se leiding wys deur oorwinning, mislukking en herstel. Let op leierskap, gebed en die gevolge van wegdraai van God. Lees Boek 17 8 self en kontroleer elke stelling teen die verse in jou Bybelweergawe.","study_points_en":[{"title":"God''s sovereignty in history","verses":"","detail":"The text of Book 17 8 records or illustrates: God''s sovereignty in history. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."},{"title":"Faithful vs. unfaithful leaders","verses":"","detail":"The text of Book 17 8 records or illustrates: Faithful vs. unfaithful leaders. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."},{"title":"Repentance and restoration","verses":"","detail":"The text of Book 17 8 records or illustrates: Repentance and restoration. Re-read those verses