f verander.","questions_en":["What does this passage reveal about God?","What promise, command, or truth stands out to you?","How can you apply this to your life today?"],"questions_af":["Wat openbaar hierdie gedeelte oor God?","Watter belofte, gebod of waarheid val vir jou op?","Hoe kan jy dit vandag in jou lewe toepas?"]},{"day":115,"title_en":"Job 1–3","title_af":"Job 1–3","passages":[{"book_id":18,"chapter":1},{"book_id":18,"chapter":2},{"book_id":18,"chapter":3}],"commentary_intro_en":"You are reading through the whole Bible. Each chapter summary below helps you grasp the main story before you read the verses.","commentary_intro_af":"Jy lees deur die hele Bybel. Elke hoofstuk-opsomming hieronder help jou die hoofverhaal te begryp voordat jy die verse lees.","commentary_sections":[{"book_id":18,"chapter":1,"heading_en":"Book 18 1","heading_af":"Boek 18 1","summary_en":"Book 18 1. Wisdom literature for worship, prayer, and practical living. Apply its truths to your relationships, work, and inner life. Read Book 18 1 yourself and verify each statement against the verses in your Bible version.","summary_af":"Boek 18 1. Wysheidsliteratuur vir aanbidding, gebed en praktiese lewe. Pas die waarhede toe op jou verhoudings, werk en innerlike lewe. Lees Boek 18 1 self en kontroleer elke stelling teen die verse in jou Bybelweergawe.","study_points_en":[{"title":"Fear of the Lord","verses":"","detail":"The text of Book 18 1 records or illustrates: Fear of the Lord. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."},{"title":"Honest self-reflection","verses":"","detail":"The text of Book 18 1 records or illustrates: Honest self-reflection. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."},{"title":"Practical daily application","verses":"","detail":"The text of Book 18 1 records or illustrates: Practical daily application. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."}],"study_points_af":[{"title":"Vrees vir die Here","verses":"","deta