r die Here. Let op gebooie, gebede of raad in hierdie hoofstuk en watter houding teenoor God dit veronderstel.\n\nSimilar elsewhere:\nBook 18 14: Compare with Book 18 14, wat direct voor hierdie hoofstuk kom — let op wat voortgaan of verander.\nSpreuke 1:7: Wysheidsboeke herhaal dat die vrees vir die Here die begin van wysheid is (Spr 1:7). Vergelyk hoe elke psalm of spreuk dit toepas.","questions_en":["What does this passage reveal about God?","What promise, command, or truth stands out to you?","How can you apply this to your life today?"],"questions_af":["Wat openbaar hierdie gedeelte oor God?","Watter belofte, gebod of waarheid val vir jou op?","Hoe kan jy dit vandag in jou lewe toepas?"]},{"day":120,"title_en":"Job 16–18","title_af":"Job 16–18","passages":[{"book_id":18,"chapter":16},{"book_id":18,"chapter":17},{"book_id":18,"chapter":18}],"commentary_intro_en":"You are reading through the whole Bible. Each chapter summary below helps you grasp the main story before you read the verses.","commentary_intro_af":"Jy lees deur die hele Bybel. Elke hoofstuk-opsomming hieronder help jou die hoofverhaal te begryp voordat jy die verse lees.","commentary_sections":[{"book_id":18,"chapter":16,"heading_en":"Book 18 16","heading_af":"Boek 18 16","summary_en":"Book 18 16. Wisdom literature for worship, prayer, and practical living. Apply its truths to your relationships, work, and inner life. Read Book 18 16 yourself and verify each statement against the verses in your Bible version.","summary_af":"Boek 18 16. Wysheidsliteratuur vir aanbidding, gebed en praktiese lewe. Pas die waarhede toe op jou verhoudings, werk en innerlike lewe. Lees Boek 18 16 self en kontroleer elke stelling teen die verse in jou Bybelweergawe.","study_points_en":[{"title":"Fear of the Lord","verses":"","detail":"The text of Book 18 16 records or illustrates: Fear of the Lord. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."},{"title":"Honest self-reflection","verses":"","detail":"The tex