 1:7: Wysheidsboeke herhaal dat die vrees vir die Here die begin van wysheid is (Spr 1:7). Vergelyk hoe elke psalm of spreuk dit toepas.","questions_en":["What does this passage reveal about God?","What promise, command, or truth stands out to you?","How can you apply this to your life today?"],"questions_af":["Wat openbaar hierdie gedeelte oor God?","Watter belofte, gebod of waarheid val vir jou op?","Hoe kan jy dit vandag in jou lewe toepas?"]},{"day":166,"title_en":"Psalms 112–114","title_af":"Psalms 112–114","passages":[{"book_id":19,"chapter":112},{"book_id":19,"chapter":113},{"book_id":19,"chapter":114}],"commentary_intro_en":"You are reading through the whole Bible. Each chapter summary below helps you grasp the main story before you read the verses.","commentary_intro_af":"Jy lees deur die hele Bybel. Elke hoofstuk-opsomming hieronder help jou die hoofverhaal te begryp voordat jy die verse lees.","commentary_sections":[{"book_id":19,"chapter":112,"heading_en":"Psalms 112","heading_af":"Psalms 112","summary_en":"Psalm 112 expresses worship, lament, or wisdom before God. Read it as prayer — many psalms foreshadow Christ and speak to every season of the soul. Read Psalms 112 yourself and verify each statement against the verses in your Bible version.","summary_af":"Psalm 112 druk aanbidding, klagte of wysheid voor God uit. Lees dit as gebed — baie psalms wys na Christus en spreek tot elke seisoen van die siel. Lees Psalms 112 self en kontroleer elke stelling teen die verse in jou Bybelweergawe.","study_points_en":[{"title":"Pray the psalm back to God","verses":"","detail":"The text of Psalms 112 records or illustrates: Pray the psalm back to God. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."},{"title":"Notice metaphors for God","verses":"","detail":"The text of Psalms 112 records or illustrates: Notice metaphors for God. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."},{"title":"Apply its emotion honestly","verses":"","detail":"The