ik God se spraak—beskuldiging, gebod of belofte. Identifiseer wat God sê Hy sal doen en wat Hy van sy volk vra.\n\nSimilar elsewhere:\nBook 26 5: Compare with Book 26 5, wat direct voor hierdie hoofstuk kom — let op wat voortgaan of verander.","questions_en":["What does this passage reveal about God?","What promise, command, or truth stands out to you?","How can you apply this to your life today?"],"questions_af":["Wat openbaar hierdie gedeelte oor God?","Watter belofte, gebod of waarheid val vir jou op?","Hoe kan jy dit vandag in jou lewe toepas?"]},{"day":239,"title_en":"Ezekiel 7–9","title_af":"Esegiël 7–9","passages":[{"book_id":26,"chapter":7},{"book_id":26,"chapter":8},{"book_id":26,"chapter":9}],"commentary_intro_en":"You are reading through the whole Bible. Each chapter summary below helps you grasp the main story before you read the verses.","commentary_intro_af":"Jy lees deur die hele Bybel. Elke hoofstuk-opsomming hieronder help jou die hoofverhaal te begryp voordat jy die verse lees.","commentary_sections":[{"book_id":26,"chapter":7,"heading_en":"Book 26 7","heading_af":"Boek 26 7","summary_en":"Book 26 7. Prophetic word calling God''s people to covenant faithfulness. Listen for judgment, hope, and promises pointing to Messiah and restoration. Read Book 26 7 yourself and verify each statement against the verses in your Bible version.","summary_af":"Boek 26 7. Profetiese woord wat God se volk roep tot verbondstrousheid. Luister vir vonnis, hoop en beloftes wat wys na Messias en herstel. Lees Boek 26 7 self en kontroleer elke stelling teen die verse in jou Bybelweergawe.","study_points_en":[{"title":"Sin and repentance","verses":"","detail":"The text of Book 26 7 records or illustrates: Sin and repentance. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."},{"title":"God''s holy standards","verses":"","detail":"The text of Book 26 7 records or illustrates: God''s holy standards. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."},{"ti