n.\n\nGospel truth\nThe text of Book 57 1 records or illustrates: Gospel truth. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states.\n\nLife in the Spirit\nThe text of Book 57 1 records or illustrates: Life in the Spirit. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states.\n\nPractical ethics\nThe text of Book 57 1 records or illustrates: Practical ethics. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states.\n\nWhat God wants us to know:\nGod wants believers to know gospel truth and how it should shape church life, holiness, and love for others.\n\nWhy:\nPaul''s letters argue from what Christ has done to how Christians should live. Find the doctrinal statement in this chapter and the conduct it connects to.\n\nBook 58 1\nBook 58 1. Pastoral encouragement for faith under pressure. Look for calls to endurance, love, holiness, and confident hope in Christ. Read Book 58 1 yourself and verify each statement against the verses in your Bible version.\n\nEndurance in trials\nThe text of Book 58 1 records or illustrates: Endurance in trials. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states.\n\nLove and unity\nThe text of Book 58 1 records or illustrates: Love and unity. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states.\n\nHope in Christ''s return\nThe text of Book 58 1 records or illustrates: Hope in Christ''s return. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states.\n\nWhat God wants us to know:\nGod wants his people to remain faithful under pressure, love one another, and hold to hope in Christ.\n\nWhy:\nThese letters encourage endurance and holy living. Notice exhortations in this chapter and the reason the writer gives for obeying them.\n\nBook 58 2\nBook 58 2. Pastoral encouragement for faith under pressure. Look for calls to endurance, love, holiness, and confident hope in Christ. Read Book 58 2 yourself and verify each statement against the verses in your Bible version.\n\nEndurance in trials\nThe text of Book 58 2 records or illustrates: Endurance in trials. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states.\n\nLove and unity\nThe text of Book 58 2 records or illustrates: Love and unity. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states.\n\nHope in Christ''s return\nThe text of Book 58 2 records or illustrates: Hope in Christ''s return. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states.\n\nWhat God wants us to know:\nGod wants his people to remain faithful under pressure, love one another, and hold to hope in Christ.\n\nWhy:\nThese letters encourage endurance and holy living. Notice exhortations in this chapter and the reason the writer gives for obeying them.\n\nSimilar elsewhere:\nBook 58 1: Compare with Book 58 1, which immediately precedes this chapter in the same book — notice what events or themes continue or change.","commentary_af":"Jy lees deur die hele Bybel. Elke hoofstuk-opsomming hieronder help jou die hoofverhaal te begryp voordat jy die verse lees.\n\nBoek 57 1\nBoek 57 1. Paulus leer leerstelling en Christelike lewe. Verbind teologiese waarheid met praktiese gehoorsaamheid in kerk, gesin en daaglikse verhoudings. Lees Boek 57 1 self en kontroleer elke stelling teen die verse in jou Bybelweergawe.\n\nEvangelie-waarheid\nDie teks van Boek 57 1 noem of illustreer: Evangelie-waarheid. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie.\n\nLewe in die Gees\nDie teks van Boek 57 1 noem of illustreer: Lewe in die Gees. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie.\n\nPraktiese etiek\nDie teks van Boek 57 1 noem of illustreer: Praktiese etiek. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie.\n\nWhat God wants us to know:\nGod wil gelowiges laat weet evangelie-waarheid en hoe dit kerklewe, heiligheid en liefde moet vorm.\n\nWhy:\nPaulus redeneer van wat Christus gedoen het na hoe Christene moet leef. Soek die leerstelling in hierdie hoofstuk en die lewe wat dit verbind.\n\nBoek 58 1\nBoek 58 1. Pastorale bemoediging vir geloof onder druk. Soek oproepe tot volharding, liefde, heiligheid en versekerde hoop in Christus. Lees Boek 58 1 self en kontroleer elke stelling teen die verse in jou Bybelweergawe.\n\nVolharding in beproewing\nDie teks van Boek 58 1 noem of illustreer: Volharding in beproewing. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie.\n\nLiefde en eenheid\nDie teks van Boek 58 1 noem of illustreer: Liefde en eenheid. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie.\n\nHoop in Christus se wederkoms\nDie teks van Boek 58 1 noem of illustreer: Hoop in Christus se wederkoms. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie.\n\nWhat God wants us to know:\nGod wil sy volk laat bly volhard onder druk, mekaar liefhê, en hoop in Christus hou.\n\nWhy:\nHierdie briewe moedig volharding en heilige lewe aan. Let op aansporings in hierdie hoofstuk en die rede wat die skrywer gee.\n\nBoek 58 2\nBoek 58 2. Pastorale bemoediging vir geloof onder druk. Soek oproepe tot volharding, liefde, heiligheid en versekerde hoop in Christus. Lees Boek 58 2 self en kontroleer elke stelling teen die verse in jou Bybelweergawe.\n\nVolharding in beproewing\nDie teks van Boek 58 2 noem of illustreer: Volharding in beproewing. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie.\n\nLiefde en eenheid\nDie teks van Boek 58 2 noem of illustreer: Liefde en eenheid. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie.\n\nHoop in Christus se wederkoms\nDie teks van Boek 58 2 noem of illustreer: Hoop in Christus se wederkoms. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie.\n\nWhat God wants us to know:\nGod wil sy volk laat bly volhard onder druk, mekaar liefhê, en hoop in Christus hou.\n\nWhy:\nHierdie briewe moedig volharding en heilige lewe aan. Let op aansporings in hierdie hoofstuk en die rede wat die skrywer gee.\n\nSimilar elsewhere:\nBook 58 1: Compare with Book 58 1, wat direct voor hierdie hoofstuk kom — let op wat voortgaan of verander.","questions_en":["What does this passage reveal about God?","What promise, command, or truth stands out to you?","How can you apply this to your life today?"],"questions_af":["Wat openbaar hierdie gedeelte oor God?","Watter belofte, gebod of waarheid val vir jou op?","Hoe kan jy dit vandag in jou lewe toepas?"]},{"day":348,"title_en":"Hebrews 3–5","title_af":"Hebreërs 3–5","passages":[{"book_id":58,"chapter":3},{"book_id":58,"chapter":4},{"book_id":58,"chapter":5}],"commentary_intro_en":"You are reading through the whole Bible. Each chapter summary below helps you grasp the main story before you read the verses.","commentary_intro_af":"Jy lees deur die hele Bybel. Elke hoofstuk-opsomming hieronder help jou die hoofverhaal te begryp voordat jy die verse lees.","commentary_sections":[{"book_id":58,"chapter":3,"heading_en":"Book 58 3","heading_af":"Boek 58 3","summary_en":"Book 58 3. Pastoral encouragement for faith under pressure. Look for calls to endurance, love, holiness, and confident hope in Christ. Read Book 58 3 yourself and verify each statement against the verses in your Bible version.","summary_af":"Boek 58 3. Pastorale bemoediging vir geloof onder druk. Soek oproepe tot volharding, liefde, heiligheid en versekerde hoop in Christus. Lees Boek 58 3 self en kontroleer elke stelling teen die verse in jou Bybelweergawe.","study_points_en":[{"title":"Endurance in trials","verses":"","detail":"The text of Book 58 3 records or illustrates: Endurance in trials. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."},{"title":"Love and unity","verses":"","detail":"The text of Book 58 3 records or illustrates: Love and unity. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."},{"title":"Hope in Christ''s return","verses":"","de