heid","Hoop in Christus se wederkoms"]},{"book_id":66,"chapter":1,"heading_en":"Revelation 1","heading_af":"Openbaring 1","summary_en":"Revelation 1. Apocalyptic vision of Christ''s victory and final renewal. Balance symbolic imagery with the certainty that God wins and His people inherit eternal life. Read Revelation 1 yourself and verify each statement against the verses in your Bible version.","summary_af":"Openbaring 1. Apokaliptiese visie van Christus se oorwinning en finale vernuwing. Balanseer simboliese beelde met die sekerheid dat God wen en Sy volk erf ewige lewe. Lees Openbaring 1 self en kontroleer elke stelling teen die verse in jou Bybelweergawe.","study_points_en":[{"title":"Christ the victorious Lamb","verses":"","detail":"The text of Revelation 1 records or illustrates: Christ the victorious Lamb. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."},{"title":"Judgment and mercy","verses":"","detail":"The text of Revelation 1 records or illustrates: Judgment and mercy. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."},{"title":"New creation hope","verses":"","detail":"The text of Revelation 1 records or illustrates: New creation hope. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."}],"study_points_af":[{"title":"Christus die oorwinnaar-Lam","verses":"","detail":"Die teks van Openbaring 1 noem of illustreer: Christus die oorwinnaar-Lam. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie."},{"title":"Vonnis en barmhartigheid","verses":"","detail":"Die teks van Openbaring 1 noem of illustreer: Vonnis en barmhartigheid. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie."},{"title":"Nuwe-skepping hoop","verses":"","detail":"Die teks van Openbaring 1 noem of illustreer: Nuwe-skepping hoop. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie."}],"teaching_en":"God wants us to know that Christ reigns, justice will be done, and 