vernuwe.\n\nWhy:\nOpenbaring gebruik visies van troon, Lam, vonnis en nuwe skepping. Identifiseer wat hierdie hoofstuk oor Christus se gesag en die toekoms rekord.\n\nSimilar elsewhere:\nBook 66 6: Compare with Book 66 6, wat direct voor hierdie hoofstuk kom — let op wat voortgaan of verander.","questions_en":["What does this passage reveal about God?","What promise, command, or truth stands out to you?","How can you apply this to your life today?"],"questions_af":["Wat openbaar hierdie gedeelte oor God?","Watter belofte, gebod of waarheid val vir jou op?","Hoe kan jy dit vandag in jou lewe toepas?"]},{"day":361,"title_en":"Revelation 8–10","title_af":"Openbaring 8–10","passages":[{"book_id":66,"chapter":8},{"book_id":66,"chapter":9},{"book_id":66,"chapter":10}],"commentary_intro_en":"You are reading through the whole Bible. Each chapter summary below helps you grasp the main story before you read the verses.","commentary_intro_af":"Jy lees deur die hele Bybel. Elke hoofstuk-opsomming hieronder help jou die hoofverhaal te begryp voordat jy die verse lees.","commentary_sections":[{"book_id":66,"chapter":8,"heading_en":"Revelation 8","heading_af":"Openbaring 8","summary_en":"Revelation 8. Apocalyptic vision of Christ''s victory and final renewal. Balance symbolic imagery with the certainty that God wins and His people inherit eternal life. Read Revelation 8 yourself and verify each statement against the verses in your Bible version.","summary_af":"Openbaring 8. Apokaliptiese visie van Christus se oorwinning en finale vernuwing. Balanseer simboliese beelde met die sekerheid dat God wen en Sy volk erf ewige lewe. Lees Openbaring 8 self en kontroleer elke stelling teen die verse in jou Bybelweergawe.","study_points_en":[{"title":"Christ the victorious Lamb","verses":"","detail":"The text of Revelation 8 records or illustrates: Christ the victorious Lamb. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."},{"title":"Judgment and mercy","verses":"","detail":"The