summary_af":"Openbaring 22. Apokaliptiese visie van Christus se oorwinning en finale vernuwing. Balanseer simboliese beelde met die sekerheid dat God wen en Sy volk erf ewige lewe. Lees Openbaring 22 self en kontroleer elke stelling teen die verse in jou Bybelweergawe.","study_points_en":[{"title":"Christ the victorious Lamb","verses":"","detail":"The text of Revelation 22 records or illustrates: Christ the victorious Lamb. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."},{"title":"Judgment and mercy","verses":"","detail":"The text of Revelation 22 records or illustrates: Judgment and mercy. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."},{"title":"New creation hope","verses":"","detail":"The text of Revelation 22 records or illustrates: New creation hope. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."}],"study_points_af":[{"title":"Christus die oorwinnaar-Lam","verses":"","detail":"Die teks van Openbaring 22 noem of illustreer: Christus die oorwinnaar-Lam. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie."},{"title":"Vonnis en barmhartigheid","verses":"","detail":"Die teks van Openbaring 22 noem of illustreer: Vonnis en barmhartigheid. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie."},{"title":"Nuwe-skepping hoop","verses":"","detail":"Die teks van Openbaring 22 noem of illustreer: Nuwe-skepping hoop. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie."}],"teaching_en":"God wants us to know that Christ reigns, justice will be done, and God will renew creation for his people.","teaching_why_en":"Revelation uses visions of throne, Lamb, judgment, and new creation. Identify what this chapter records about Christ''s authority and the future God promises.","teaching_af":"God wil hê ons moet weet dat Christus regeer, geregtigheid geskied, en God die skepping vir sy volk sal vernuwe.","teaching_why_af":"Openbaring gebruik visies van troon, Lam, vonnis en nuwe skepping. Identifiseer wat hierdie hoofstuk oor Christus se gesag en die toekoms rekord.","cross_references_en":[{"ref":"Book 66 21","comparison":"Compare with Book 66 21, which immediately precedes this chapter in the same book — notice what events or themes continue or change."}],"cross_references_af":[{"ref":"Book 66 21","comparison":"Compare with Book 66 21, wat direct voor hierdie hoofstuk kom — let op wat voortgaan of verander."}],"highlights_en":["Christ the victorious Lamb","Judgment and mercy","New creation hope"],"highlights_af":["Christus die oorwinnaar-Lam","Vonnis en barmhartigheid","Nuwe-skepping hoop"]}],"commentary_en":"You are reading through the whole Bible. Each chapter summary below helps you grasp the main story before you read the verses.\n\nRevelation 20\nRevelation 20. Apocalyptic vision of Christ''s victory and final renewal. Balance symbolic imagery with the certainty that God wins and His people inherit eternal life. Read Revelation 20 yourself and verify each statement against the verses in your Bible version.\n\nChrist the victorious Lamb\nThe text of Revelation 20 records or illustrates: Christ the victorious Lamb. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states.\n\nJudgment and mercy\nThe text of Revelation 20 records or illustrates: Judgment and mercy. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states.\n\nNew creation hope\nThe text of Revelation 20 records or illustrates: New creation hope. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states.\n\nWhat God wants us to know:\nGod wants us to know that Christ reigns, justice will be done, and God will renew creation for his people.\n\nWhy:\nRevelation uses visions of throne, Lamb, judgment, and new creation. Identify what this chapter records about Christ''s authority and the future God promises.\n\nSimilar elsewhere:\nBook 66 19: Compare with Book 66 19, which immediately precedes this chapter in the same book — notice what events or themes continue or change.\n\nRevelation 21\nRevelation 21. Apocalyptic vision of Christ''s victory and final renewal. Balance symbolic imagery with the certainty that God wins and His people inherit eternal life. Read Revelation 21 yourself and verify each statement against the verses in your Bible version.\n\nChrist the victorious Lamb\nThe text of Revelation 21 records or illustrates: Christ the victorious Lamb. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states.\n\nJudgment and mercy\nThe text of Revelation 21 records or illustrates: Judgment and mercy. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states.\n\nNew creation hope\nThe text of Revelation 21 records or illustrates: New creation hope. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states.\n\nWhat God wants us to know:\nGod wants us to know that Christ reigns, justice will be done, and God will renew creation for his people.\n\nWhy:\nRevelation uses visions of throne, Lamb, judgment, and new creation. Identify what this chapter records about Christ''s authority and the future God promises.\n\nSimilar elsewhere:\nBook 66 20: Compare with Book 66 20, which immediately precedes this chapter in the same book — notice what events or themes continue or change.\n\nRevelation 22\nRevelation 22. Apocalyptic vision of Christ''s victory and final renewal. Balance symbolic imagery with the certainty that God wins and His people inherit eternal life. Read Revelation 22 yourself and verify each statement against the verses in your Bible version.\n\nChrist the victorious Lamb\nThe text of Revelation 22 records or illustrates: Christ the victorious Lamb. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states.\n\nJudgment and mercy\nThe text of Revelation 22 records or illustrates: Judgment and mercy. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states.\n\nNew creation hope\nThe text of Revelation 22 records or illustrates: New creation hope. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states.\n\nWhat God wants us to know:\nGod wants us to know that Christ reigns, justice will be done, and God will renew creation for his people.\n\nWhy:\nRevelation uses visions of throne, Lamb, judgment, and new creation. Identify what this chapter records about Christ''s authority and the future God promises.\n\nSimilar elsewhere:\nBook 66 21: Compare with Book 66 21, which immediately precedes this chapter in the same book — notice what events or themes continue or change.","commentary_af":"Jy lees deur die hele Bybel. Elke hoofstuk-opsomming hieronder help jou die hoofverhaal te begryp voordat jy die verse lees.\n\nOpenbaring 20\nOpenbaring 20. Apokaliptiese visie van Christus se oorwinning en finale vernuwing. Balanseer simboliese beelde met die sekerheid dat God wen en Sy volk erf ewige lewe. Lees Openbaring 20 self en kontroleer elke stelling teen die verse in jou Bybelweergawe.\n\nChristus die oorwinnaar-Lam\nDie teks van Openbaring 20 noem of illustreer: Christus die oorwinnaar-Lam. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie.\n\nVonnis en barmhartigheid\nDie teks van Openbaring 20 noem of illustreer: Vonnis en barmhartigheid. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie.\n\nNuwe-skepping hoop\nDie teks van Openbaring 20 noem of illustreer: Nuwe-skepping hoop. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie.\n\nWhat God wants us to know:\nGod wil hê ons moet weet dat Christus regeer, geregtigheid geskied, en God die skepping vir sy volk sal vernuwe.\n\nWhy:\nOpenbaring gebruik visies van troon, Lam, vonnis en nuwe skepping. Identifiseer wat hierdie hoofstuk oor Christus se gesag en die toekoms rekord.\n\nSimilar elsewhere:\nBook 66 19: Compare with Book 66 19, wat direct voor hierdie hoofstuk kom — let op wat voortgaan of verander.\n\nOpenbaring 21\nOpenbaring 21. Apokaliptiese visie van Christus se oorwinning en finale vernuwing. Balanseer simboliese beelde met die sekerheid dat God wen en Sy volk erf ewige lewe. Lees Openbaring 21 self en kontroleer elke stelling teen die verse in jou Bybelweergawe.\n\nChristus die oorwinnaar-Lam\nDie teks van Openbaring 21 noem of illustreer: Christus die oorwinnaar-Lam. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie.\n\nVonnis en barmhartigheid\nDie teks van Openbaring 21 noem of illustreer: Vonnis en barmhartigheid. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie.\n\nNuwe-skepping hoop\nDie teks van Openbaring 21 noem of illustreer: Nuwe-skepping hoop. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie.\n\nWhat God wants us to know:\nGod wil hê ons moet weet dat Christus regeer, geregtigheid geskied, en God die skepping vir sy volk sal vernuwe.\n\nWhy:\nOpenbaring gebruik visies van troon, Lam, vonnis en nuwe skepping. Identifiseer wat hierdie hoofstuk oor Christus se gesag en die toekoms rekord.\n\nSimilar elsewhere:\nBook 66 20: Compare with Book 66 20, wat direct voor hierdie hoofstuk kom — let op wat voortgaan of verander.\n\nOpenbaring 22\nOpenbaring 22. Apokaliptiese visie van Christus se oorwinning en finale vernuwing. Balanseer simboliese beelde met die sekerheid dat God wen en Sy volk erf ewige lewe. Lees Openbaring 22 self en kontroleer elke stelling teen die verse in jou Bybelweergawe.\n\nChristus die oorwinnaar-Lam\nDie teks van Openbaring 22 noem of illustreer: Christus die oorwinnaar-Lam. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie.\n\nVonnis en barmhartigheid\nDie teks van Openbaring 22 noem of illustreer: Vonnis en barmhartigheid. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie.\n\nNuwe-skepping hoop\nDie teks van Openbaring 22 noem of illustreer: Nuwe-skepping hoop. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie.\n\nWhat God wants us to know:\nGod wil hê ons moet weet dat Christus regeer, geregtigheid geskied, en God die skepping vir sy volk sal vernuwe.\n\nWhy:\nOpenbaring gebruik visies van troon, Lam, vonnis en nuwe skepping. Identifiseer wat hierdie hoofstuk oor Christus se gesag en die toekoms rekord.\n\nSimilar elsewhere:\nBook 66 21: Compare with Book 66 21, wat direct voor hierdie hoofstuk kom — let op wat voortgaan of verander.","questions_en":["What does this passage reveal about God?","What promise, command, or truth stands out to you?","How can you apply this to your life today?"],"questions_af":["Wat openbaar hierdie gedeelte oor God?","Watter belofte, gebod of waarheid val vir jou op?","Hoe kan jy dit vandag in jou lewe toepas?"]}]'::jsonb,
    '📚',
    5,
    true
)
