eet dat Hy verhouding begin met belofte en gebod, en vertroue en gehoorsaamheid verwag.\n\nWhy:\nPentateug-hoofstukke beskryf gewoonlik wat God gesê en gedoen het—kyk vir God se directe spraak en die reaksie wat hierdie hoofstuk van sy volk vra.\n\nSimilar elsewhere:\nGenesis 23: Compare with Genesis 23, wat direct voor hierdie hoofstuk kom — let op wat voortgaan of verander.\nDeuteronomium 30:15–20: Soos ander Pentateug-hoofstukke vorm hierdie teks deel van Moses se verbondsinstruksie. Deut 30 stel lewe en dood, seën en vloek, voor Israel.","questions_en":["What does this passage reveal about God?","What promise, command, or truth stands out to you?","How can you apply this to your life today?"],"questions_af":["Wat openbaar hierdie gedeelte oor God?","Watter belofte, gebod of waarheid val vir jou op?","Hoe kan jy dit vandag in jou lewe toepas?"]},{"day":5,"title_en":"Genesis 25–30","title_af":"Genesis 25–30","passages":[{"book_id":1,"chapter":25},{"book_id":1,"chapter":26},{"book_id":1,"chapter":27},{"book_id":1,"chapter":28},{"book_id":1,"chapter":29},{"book_id":1,"chapter":30}],"commentary_intro_en":"Old Testament narrative and teaching. Use the chapter summaries to track God''s covenant story across history.","commentary_intro_af":"Ou Testament verhaal en lering. Gebruik die hoofstuk-opsommings om God se verbondverhaal deur die geskiedenis te volg.","commentary_sections":[{"book_id":1,"chapter":25,"heading_en":"Genesis 25","heading_af":"Genesis 25","summary_en":"Abraham dies; Esau and Jacob born; birthright sold for stew. Read Genesis 25 yourself and verify each statement against the verses in your Bible version.","summary_af":"Abraham sterf; Esau en Jakob gebore; geboorte reg verkoop vir bredie. Lees Genesis 25 self en kontroleer elke stelling teen die verse in jou Bybelweergawe.","study_points_en":[{"title":"Key events in God''s covenant story","verses":"","detail":"The text of Genesis 25 records or illustrates: Key events in God''s covenant story. Re-read th