"chapter":23,"heading_en":"Psalms 23","heading_af":"Psalms 23","summary_en":"The Lord is my shepherd — provision, guidance, protection, and dwelling in God''s house forever. Read Psalms 23 yourself and verify each statement against the verses in your Bible version.","summary_af":"Die Here is my Herder — voorsiening, leiding, beskerming en woning in God se huis vir altyd. Lees Psalms 23 self en kontroleer elke stelling teen die verse in jou Bybelweergawe.","study_points_en":[{"title":"The Lord shepherds me","verses":"","detail":"The text of Psalms 23 records or illustrates: The Lord shepherds me. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."},{"title":"Valley of shadow — fear no evil","verses":"","detail":"The text of Psalms 23 records or illustrates: Valley of shadow — fear no evil. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."},{"title":"Goodness and mercy follow","verses":"","detail":"The text of Psalms 23 records or illustrates: Goodness and mercy follow. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."}],"study_points_af":[{"title":"Die Here weid my","verses":"","detail":"Die teks van Psalms 23 noem of illustreer: Die Here weid my. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie."},{"title":"Skaduwee-vallei — geen vrees","verses":"","detail":"Die teks van Psalms 23 noem of illustreer: Skaduwee-vallei — geen vrees. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie."},{"title":"Goedertierenheid en barmhartigheid volg","verses":"","detail":"Die teks van Psalms 23 noem of illustreer: Goedertierenheid en barmhartigheid volg. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie."}],"teaching_en":"God wants us to know that true wisdom begins with reverence for him and shapes daily choices, speech, and worship.","teaching_why_en":"Wisdom passages tie understanding to the fear of the Lord and practical living. Notice commands, prayers, or counsel in this chapter and what attitude toward God they assume.","teaching_af":"God wil hê ons moet weet dat ware wysheid begin met eerbied vir Hom en daaglikse keuses, spraak en aanbidding vorm.","teaching_why_af":"Wysheid verbind insig met die vrees vir die Here. Let op gebooie, gebede of raad in hierdie hoofstuk en watter houding teenoor God dit veronderstel.","cross_references_en":[{"ref":"John 10:11","comparison":"Psalm 23:1 says \"The Lord is my shepherd.\" John 10:11 records Jesus saying \"I am the good shepherd.\" Both use shepherd language — one in a psalm, one in Jesus'' speech."},{"ref":"Revelation 7:17","comparison":"Psalm 23 speaks of the Lord shepherding and dwelling with the psalmist. Revelation 7:17 says the Lamb will shepherd and lead to living waters — similar shepherd-and-guidance imagery."}],"cross_references_af":[{"ref":"Johannes 10:11","comparison":"Psalm 23:1 sê \"Die Here is my Herder.\" Johannes 10:11 beskryf Jesus wat sê \"Ek is die goeie Herder.\" Beide gebruik herder-taal."},{"ref":"Openbaring 7:17","comparison":"Psalm 23 praat van die Here as Herder. Openbaring 7:17 sê die Lam sal weid en lei na lewende waters — soortgelyke herder-beeld."}],"highlights_en":["The Lord shepherds me","Valley of shadow — fear no evil","Goodness and mercy follow"],"highlights_af":["Die Here weid my","Skaduwee-vallei — geen vrees","Goedertierenheid en barmhartigheid volg"]},{"book_id":19,"chapter":24,"heading_en":"Psalms 24","heading_af":"Psalms 24","summary_en":"Psalm 24 expresses worship, lament, or wisdom before God. Read it as prayer — many psalms foreshadow Christ and speak to every season of the soul. Read Psalms 24 yourself and verify each statement against the verses in your Bible version.","summary_af":"Psalm 24 druk aanbidding, klagte of wysheid voor God uit. Lees dit as gebed — baie psalms wys na Christus en spreek tot elke seisoen van die siel. Lees Psalms 24 self en kontroleer elke stelling teen die verse in jou Bybelweergawe.","study_p