erse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie.\n\nWhat God wants us to know:\nGod wil hê ons moet weet dat ware wysheid begin met eerbied vir Hom en daaglikse keuses, spraak en aanbidding vorm.\n\nWhy:\nWysheid verbind insig met die vrees vir die Here. Let op gebooie, gebede of raad in hierdie hoofstuk en watter houding teenoor God dit veronderstel.\n\nSimilar elsewhere:\nPsalms 40: Compare with Psalms 40, wat direct voor hierdie hoofstuk kom — let op wat voortgaan of verander.\nSpreuke 1:7: Wysheidsboeke herhaal dat die vrees vir die Here die begin van wysheid is (Spr 1:7). Vergelyk hoe elke psalm of spreuk dit toepas.","questions_en":["What does this passage reveal about God?","What promise, command, or truth stands out to you?","How can you apply this to your life today?"],"questions_af":["Wat openbaar hierdie gedeelte oor God?","Watter belofte, gebod of waarheid val vir jou op?","Hoe kan jy dit vandag in jou lewe toepas?"]},{"day":99,"title_en":"Psalms 42–46","title_af":"Psalms 42–46","passages":[{"book_id":19,"chapter":42},{"book_id":19,"chapter":43},{"book_id":19,"chapter":44},{"book_id":19,"chapter":45},{"book_id":19,"chapter":46}],"commentary_intro_en":"Old Testament narrative and teaching. Use the chapter summaries to track God''s covenant story across history.","commentary_intro_af":"Ou Testament verhaal en lering. Gebruik die hoofstuk-opsommings om God se verbondverhaal deur die geskiedenis te volg.","commentary_sections":[{"book_id":19,"chapter":42,"heading_en":"Psalms 42","heading_af":"Psalms 42","summary_en":"Psalm 42 expresses worship, lament, or wisdom before God. Read it as prayer — many psalms foreshadow Christ and speak to every season of the soul. Read Psalms 42 yourself and verify each statement against the verses in your Bible version.","summary_af":"Psalm 42 druk aanbidding, klagte of wysheid voor God uit. Lees dit as gebed — baie psalms wys na Christus en spreek tot elke seisoen van die siel. Lees Psalms 42 self en kont