el om vandag te oefen\nDie teks van Spreuke 1 noem of illustreer: Een beginsel om vandag te oefen. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie.\n\nWhat God wants us to know:\nGod wil hê ons moet weet dat ware wysheid begin met eerbied vir Hom en daaglikse keuses, spraak en aanbidding vorm.\n\nWhy:\nWysheid verbind insig met die vrees vir die Here. Let op gebooie, gebede of raad in hierdie hoofstuk en watter houding teenoor God dit veronderstel.\n\nSimilar elsewhere:\nSpreuke 1:7: Wysheidsboeke herhaal dat die vrees vir die Here die begin van wysheid is (Spr 1:7). Vergelyk hoe elke psalm of spreuk dit toepas.","questions_en":["What does this passage reveal about God?","What promise, command, or truth stands out to you?","How can you apply this to your life today?"],"questions_af":["Wat openbaar hierdie gedeelte oor God?","Watter belofte, gebod of waarheid val vir jou op?","Hoe kan jy dit vandag in jou lewe toepas?"]},{"day":121,"title_en":"Proverbs 2–6","title_af":"Spreuke 2–6","passages":[{"book_id":20,"chapter":2},{"book_id":20,"chapter":3},{"book_id":20,"chapter":4},{"book_id":20,"chapter":5},{"book_id":20,"chapter":6}],"commentary_intro_en":"Old Testament narrative and teaching. Use the chapter summaries to track God''s covenant story across history.","commentary_intro_af":"Ou Testament verhaal en lering. Gebruik die hoofstuk-opsommings om God se verbondverhaal deur die geskiedenis te volg.","commentary_sections":[{"book_id":20,"chapter":2,"heading_en":"Proverbs 2","heading_af":"Spreuke 2","summary_en":"Seek wisdom like treasure; moral protection from evil paths. Read Proverbs 2 yourself and verify each statement against the verses in your Bible version.","summary_af":"Soek wysheid soos skat; morele beskerming van bose paaie. Lees Spreuke 2 self en kontroleer elke stelling teen die verse in jou Bybelweergawe.","study_points_en":[{"title":"Practical wisdom for daily choices","verses":"","detail":"The text of Proverbs 2 record