 verbind.\n\nSimilar elsewhere:\nRomeine 5: Compare with Romeine 5, wat direct voor hierdie hoofstuk kom — let op wat voortgaan of verander.","questions_en":["What does this passage reveal about God?","What promise, command, or truth stands out to you?","How can you apply this to your life today?"],"questions_af":["Wat openbaar hierdie gedeelte oor God?","Watter belofte, gebod of waarheid val vir jou op?","Hoe kan jy dit vandag in jou lewe toepas?"]},{"day":3,"title_en":"Romans 7–9","title_af":"Romeine 7–9","passages":[{"book_id":45,"chapter":7},{"book_id":45,"chapter":8},{"book_id":45,"chapter":9}],"commentary_intro_en":"Paul''s letters teach doctrine and life. Each chapter summary highlights key themes before you read.","commentary_intro_af":"Paulus se briewe leer leerstelling en lewe. Elke hoofstuk-opsomming beklemtoon sleutel temas voordat jy lees.","commentary_sections":[{"book_id":45,"chapter":7,"heading_en":"Romans 7","heading_af":"Romeine 7","summary_en":"Romans 7. Paul teaches doctrine and Christian living. Connect theological truth to practical obedience in church, family, and daily relationships. Read Romans 7 yourself and verify each statement against the verses in your Bible version.","summary_af":"Romeine 7. Paulus leer leerstelling en Christelike lewe. Verbind teologiese waarheid met praktiese gehoorsaamheid in kerk, gesin en daaglikse verhoudings. Lees Romeine 7 self en kontroleer elke stelling teen die verse in jou Bybelweergawe.","study_points_en":[{"title":"Gospel truth","verses":"","detail":"The text of Romans 7 records or illustrates: Gospel truth. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."},{"title":"Life in the Spirit","verses":"","detail":"The text of Romans 7 records or illustrates: Life in the Spirit. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."},{"title":"Practical ethics","verses":"","detail":"The text of Romans 7 records or illustrates: Practical ethics. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scrip