 Bestudeer elke hoofstuk-afdeling hieronder terwyl jy lees.","commentary_sections":[{"book_id":45,"chapter":8,"heading_en":"Romans 8","heading_af":"Romeine 8","summary_en":"No condemnation for those in Christ. Life in the Spirit vs. flesh. All things work together; nothing separates from God''s love. Read Romans 8 yourself and verify each statement against the verses in your Bible version.","summary_af":"Geen veroordeling vir die wat in Christus is. Lewe in die Gees vs. vlees. Alles werk saam; niks skei van God se liefde. Lees Romeine 8 self en kontroleer elke stelling teen die verse in jou Bybelweergawe.","study_points_en":[{"title":"No condemnation in Christ","verses":"","detail":"The text of Romans 8 records or illustrates: No condemnation in Christ. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."},{"title":"Spirit gives life","verses":"","detail":"The text of Romans 8 records or illustrates: Spirit gives life. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."},{"title":"Nothing can separate us from love","verses":"","detail":"The text of Romans 8 records or illustrates: Nothing can separate us from love. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."}],"study_points_af":[{"title":"Geen veroordeling in Christus","verses":"","detail":"Die teks van Romeine 8 noem of illustreer: Geen veroordeling in Christus. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie."},{"title":"Gees gee lewe","verses":"","detail":"Die teks van Romeine 8 noem of illustreer: Gees gee lewe. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie."},{"title":"Niks kan ons van liefde skei","verses":"","detail":"Die teks van Romeine 8 noem of illustreer: Niks kan ons van liefde skei. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie."}],"teaching_en":"God wants believers to know gospel truth and how it should shape church life, holiness, and love for others.","teaching_why_en":"Paul''s letters argue from what Christ has done to how Christians should live. Find the doctrinal statement in this chapter and the conduct it connects to.","teaching_af":"God wil gelowiges laat weet evangelie-waarheid en hoe dit kerklewe, heiligheid en liefde moet vorm.","teaching_why_af":"Paulus redeneer van wat Christus gedoen het na hoe Christene moet leef. Soek die leerstelling in hierdie hoofstuk en die lewe wat dit verbind.","cross_references_en":[{"ref":"Romans 8:1","comparison":"Romans 8:1 states there is no condemnation for those in Christ Jesus. Romans 8:2–4 contrasts life in the Spirit with the law of sin and death — continuing the same argument in one chapter."},{"ref":"John 5:24","comparison":"Romans 8:1 speaks of no condemnation for those in Christ. John 5:24 records Jesus saying whoever hears and believes has eternal life and does not come into judgment — similar no-condemnation language."}],"cross_references_af":[{"ref":"Romeine 8:1","comparison":"Romeine 8:1 sê daar is geen veroordeling vir die wat in Christus Jesus is nie. Romeine 8:2–4 kontrasteer lewe in die Gees met die wet van sonde en dood."},{"ref":"Johannes 5:24","comparison":"Romeine 8:1 spreek van geen veroordeling vir die in Christus nie. Johannes 5:24 beskryf Jesus wat sê wie hoor en glo het ewige lewe en nie in veroordeling kom nie."}],"highlights_en":["No condemnation in Christ","Spirit gives life","Nothing can separate us from love"],"highlights_af":["Geen veroordeling in Christus","Gees gee lewe","Niks kan ons van liefde skei"]}],"commentary_en":"Today''s themed reading: Romans 8. Study each chapter section below as you read.\n\nRomans 8\nNo condemnation for those in Christ. Life in the Spirit vs. flesh. All things work together; nothing separates from God''s love. Read Romans 8 yourself and verify each statement against the verses in your Bible version.\n\nNo condemnation in Christ\nThe text of Romans 8 records or illustrates: No condemnation in Christ. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states.\n\nSpirit gives life\nThe text of Romans 8 records or illustrates: Spirit gives life. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states.\n\nNothing can separate us from love\nThe text of Romans 8 records or illustrates: Nothing can separate us from love. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states.\n\nWhat God wants us to know:\nGod wants believers to know gospel truth and how it should shape church life, holiness, and love for others.\n\nWhy:\nPaul''s letters argue from what Christ has done to how Christians should live. Find the doctrinal statement in this chapter and the conduct it connects to.\n\nSimilar elsewhere:\nRomans 8:1: Romans 8:1 states there is no condemnation for those in Christ Jesus. Romans 8:2–4 contrasts life in the Spirit with the law of sin and death — continuing the same argument in one chapter.\nJohn 5:24: Romans 8:1 speaks of no condemnation for those in Christ. John 5:24 records Jesus saying whoever hears and believes has eternal life and does not come into judgment — similar no-condemnation language.","commentary_af":"Vandag se tematiese leeswerk: Romeine 8. Bestudeer elke hoofstuk-afdeling hieronder terwyl jy lees.\n\nRomeine 8\nGeen veroordeling vir die wat in Christus is. Lewe in die Gees vs. vlees. Alles werk saam; niks skei van God se liefde. Lees Romeine 8 self en kontroleer elke stelling teen die verse in jou Bybelweergawe.\n\nGeen veroordeling in Christus\nDie teks van Romeine 8 noem of illustreer: Geen veroordeling in Christus. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie.\n\nGees gee lewe\nDie teks van Romeine 8 noem of illustreer: Gees gee lewe. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie.\n\nNiks kan ons van liefde skei\nDie teks van Romeine 8 noem of illustreer: Niks kan ons van liefde skei. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie.\n\nWhat God wants us to know:\nGod wil gelowiges laat weet evangelie-waarheid en hoe dit kerklewe, heiligheid en liefde moet vorm.\n\nWhy:\nPaulus redeneer van wat Christus gedoen het na hoe Christene moet leef. Soek die leerstelling in hierdie hoofstuk en die lewe wat dit verbind.\n\nSimilar elsewhere:\nRomeine 8:1: Romeine 8:1 sê daar is geen veroordeling vir die wat in Christus Jesus is nie. Romeine 8:2–4 kontrasteer lewe in die Gees met die wet van sonde en dood.\nJohannes 5:24: Romeine 8:1 spreek van geen veroordeling vir die in Christus nie. Johannes 5:24 beskryf Jesus wat sê wie hoor en glo het ewige lewe en nie in veroordeling kom nie.","questions_en":["What does this passage reveal about God?","What promise, command, or truth stands out to you?","How can you apply this to your life today?"],"questions_af":["Wat openbaar hierdie gedeelte oor God?","Watter belofte, gebod of waarheid val vir jou op?","Hoe kan jy dit vandag in jou lewe toepas?"]},{"day":9,"title_en":"Romans 9","title_af":"Romeine 9","passages":[{"book_id":45,"chapter":9}],"commentary_intro_en":"Today''s themed reading: Romans 9. Study each chapter section below as you read.","commentary_intro_af":"Vandag se tematiese leeswerk: Romeine 9. Bestudeer elke hoofstuk-afdeling hieronder terwyl jy lees.","commentary_sections":[{"book_id":45,"chapter":9,"heading_en":"Romans 9","heading_af":"Romeine 9","summary_en":"Romans 9. Paul teaches doctrine and Christian living. Connect theological truth to practical obedience in church, family, and daily relationships. Read Romans 9 yourself and verify each statement against the verses in your Bible version.","summary_af":"Romeine 9. Paulus leer leerstelling en Christelike lewe. Verbind teologiese waarheid met praktiese gehoorsaamheid in kerk, gesin en daaglikse verhoudings. Lees Romeine 9 self en kontroleer elke stelling teen die verse in jou Bybelweergawe.","study_points_en":[{"title":"Gospel truth","verses":"","detail":"The text of Romans 9 records or illustrates: 