s and note exactly what Scripture states.\n\nWhat God wants us to know:\nGod wants his people to know that he calls them back to faithfulness, warns of judgment, and often pairs correction with hope.\n\nWhy:\nProphetic chapters usually contain God''s speech—accusation, command, or promise. Identify what God says he will do and what he asks his people to do.\n\nSimilar elsewhere:\nBook 24 28: Compare with Book 24 28, which immediately precedes this chapter in the same book — notice what events or themes continue or change.","commentary_af":"Vandag se tematiese leeswerk: Planne van Hoop. Bestudeer elke hoofstuk-afdeling hieronder terwyl jy lees.\n\nBoek 24 29\nBoek 24 29. Profetiese woord wat God se volk roep tot verbondstrousheid. Luister vir vonnis, hoop en beloftes wat wys na Messias en herstel. Lees Boek 24 29 self en kontroleer elke stelling teen die verse in jou Bybelweergawe.\n\nSonde en berou\nDie teks van Boek 24 29 noem of illustreer: Sonde en berou. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie.\n\nGod se heilige standaarde\nDie teks van Boek 24 29 noem of illustreer: God se heilige standaarde. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie.\n\nHoop vir die toekoms\nDie teks van Boek 24 29 noem of illustreer: Hoop vir die toekoms. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie.\n\nWhat God wants us to know:\nGod wil sy volk laat weet dat Hy hulle terugroep na trou, waarsku vir vonnis, en korreksie dikwels met hoop paar.\n\nWhy:\nProfetiese hoofstukke bevat gewoonlik God se spraak—beskuldiging, gebod of belofte. Identifiseer wat God sê Hy sal doen en wat Hy van sy volk vra.\n\nSimilar elsewhere:\nBook 24 28: Compare with Book 24 28, wat direct voor hierdie hoofstuk kom — let op wat voortgaan of verander.","questions_en":["What does this passage reveal about God?","What promise, command, or truth stands out to you?","How can you apply this to your life today?"],"questions_af":["Wat openbaar hierdie gedeelte oor God?","Watter belofte, gebod of waarheid val vir jou op?","Hoe kan jy dit vandag in jou lewe toepas?"]},{"day":5,"title_en":"Comfort My People","title_af":"Troos My Volk","passages":[{"book_id":23,"chapter":40}],"commentary_intro_en":"Today''s themed reading: Comfort My People. Study each chapter section below as you read.","commentary_intro_af":"Vandag se tematiese leeswerk: Troos My Volk. Bestudeer elke hoofstuk-afdeling hieronder terwyl jy lees.","commentary_sections":[{"book_id":23,"chapter":40,"heading_en":"Book 23 40","heading_af":"Boek 23 40","summary_en":"Book 23 40. Prophetic word calling God''s people to covenant faithfulness. Listen for judgment, hope, and promises pointing to Messiah and restoration. Read Book 23 40 yourself and verify each statement against the verses in your Bible version.","summary_af":"Boek 23 40. Profetiese woord wat God se volk roep tot verbondstrousheid. Luister vir vonnis, hoop en beloftes wat wys na Messias en herstel. Lees Boek 23 40 self en kontroleer elke stelling teen die verse in jou Bybelweergawe.","study_points_en":[{"title":"Sin and repentance","verses":"","detail":"The text of Book 23 40 records or illustrates: Sin and repentance. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."},{"title":"God''s holy standards","verses":"","detail":"The text of Book 23 40 records or illustrates: God''s holy standards. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."},{"title":"Hope for the future","verses":"","detail":"The text of Book 23 40 records or illustrates: Hope for the future. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."}],"study_points_af":[{"title":"Sonde en berou","verses":"","detail":"Die teks van Boek 23 40 noem of illustreer: Sonde en berou. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie."},{"title":"God se heilige standaarde","verses":"","detail":"Die teks van Boek 23 40 noem of ill