 Compare with Book 23 39, wat direct voor hierdie hoofstuk kom — let op wat voortgaan of verander.","questions_en":["What does this passage reveal about God?","What promise, command, or truth stands out to you?","How can you apply this to your life today?"],"questions_af":["Wat openbaar hierdie gedeelte oor God?","Watter belofte, gebod of waarheid val vir jou op?","Hoe kan jy dit vandag in jou lewe toepas?"]},{"day":6,"title_en":"By Faith","title_af":"Deur Geloof","passages":[{"book_id":58,"chapter":11}],"commentary_intro_en":"Today''s themed reading: By Faith. Study each chapter section below as you read.","commentary_intro_af":"Vandag se tematiese leeswerk: Deur Geloof. Bestudeer elke hoofstuk-afdeling hieronder terwyl jy lees.","commentary_sections":[{"book_id":58,"chapter":11,"heading_en":"Book 58 11","heading_af":"Boek 58 11","summary_en":"Book 58 11. Pastoral encouragement for faith under pressure. Look for calls to endurance, love, holiness, and confident hope in Christ. Read Book 58 11 yourself and verify each statement against the verses in your Bible version.","summary_af":"Boek 58 11. Pastorale bemoediging vir geloof onder druk. Soek oproepe tot volharding, liefde, heiligheid en versekerde hoop in Christus. Lees Boek 58 11 self en kontroleer elke stelling teen die verse in jou Bybelweergawe.","study_points_en":[{"title":"Endurance in trials","verses":"","detail":"The text of Book 58 11 records or illustrates: Endurance in trials. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."},{"title":"Love and unity","verses":"","detail":"The text of Book 58 11 records or illustrates: Love and unity. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."},{"title":"Hope in Christ''s return","verses":"","detail":"The text of Book 58 11 records or illustrates: Hope in Christ''s return. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."}],"study_points_af":[{"title":"Volharding in beproewing","verses":"","detail":"Die teks van Boek 58 11 no