skrywer gee.\n\nSimilar elsewhere:\nBook 58 10: Compare with Book 58 10, wat direct voor hierdie hoofstuk kom — let op wat voortgaan of verander.","questions_en":["What does this passage reveal about God?","What promise, command, or truth stands out to you?","How can you apply this to your life today?"],"questions_af":["Wat openbaar hierdie gedeelte oor God?","Watter belofte, gebod of waarheid val vir jou op?","Hoe kan jy dit vandag in jou lewe toepas?"]},{"day":7,"title_en":"Abraham Justified by Faith","title_af":"Abraham Geregtig Deur Geloof","passages":[{"book_id":45,"chapter":4}],"commentary_intro_en":"Today''s themed reading: Abraham Justified by Faith. Study each chapter section below as you read.","commentary_intro_af":"Vandag se tematiese leeswerk: Abraham Geregtig Deur Geloof. Bestudeer elke hoofstuk-afdeling hieronder terwyl jy lees.","commentary_sections":[{"book_id":45,"chapter":4,"heading_en":"Romans 4","heading_af":"Romeine 4","summary_en":"Romans 4. Paul teaches doctrine and Christian living. Connect theological truth to practical obedience in church, family, and daily relationships. Read Romans 4 yourself and verify each statement against the verses in your Bible version.","summary_af":"Romeine 4. Paulus leer leerstelling en Christelike lewe. Verbind teologiese waarheid met praktiese gehoorsaamheid in kerk, gesin en daaglikse verhoudings. Lees Romeine 4 self en kontroleer elke stelling teen die verse in jou Bybelweergawe.","study_points_en":[{"title":"Gospel truth","verses":"","detail":"The text of Romans 4 records or illustrates: Gospel truth. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."},{"title":"Life in the Spirit","verses":"","detail":"The text of Romans 4 records or illustrates: Life in the Spirit. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."},{"title":"Practical ethics","verses":"","detail":"The text of Romans 4 records or illustrates: Practical ethics. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."}],"study_points_af":[{"title":"Evangelie-waarheid","verses":"","detail":"Die teks van Romeine 4 noem of illustreer: Evangelie-waarheid. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie."},{"title":"Lewe in die Gees","verses":"","detail":"Die teks van Romeine 4 noem of illustreer: Lewe in die Gees. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie."},{"title":"Praktiese etiek","verses":"","detail":"Die teks van Romeine 4 noem of illustreer: Praktiese etiek. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie."}],"teaching_en":"God wants believers to know gospel truth and how it should shape church life, holiness, and love for others.","teaching_why_en":"Paul''s letters argue from what Christ has done to how Christians should live. Find the doctrinal statement in this chapter and the conduct it connects to.","teaching_af":"God wil gelowiges laat weet evangelie-waarheid en hoe dit kerklewe, heiligheid en liefde moet vorm.","teaching_why_af":"Paulus redeneer van wat Christus gedoen het na hoe Christene moet leef. Soek die leerstelling in hierdie hoofstuk en die lewe wat dit verbind.","cross_references_en":[{"ref":"Romans 3","comparison":"Compare with Romans 3, which immediately precedes this chapter in the same book — notice what events or themes continue or change."}],"cross_references_af":[{"ref":"Romeine 3","comparison":"Compare with Romeine 3, wat direct voor hierdie hoofstuk kom — let op wat voortgaan of verander."}],"highlights_en":["Gospel truth","Life in the Spirit","Practical ethics"],"highlights_af":["Evangelie-waarheid","Lewe in die Gees","Praktiese etiek"]}],"commentary_en":"Today''s themed reading: Abraham Justified by Faith. Study each chapter section below as you read.\n\nRomans 4\nRomans 4. Paul teaches doctrine and Christian living. Connect theological truth to practical obedience in church, family, and daily relationships. Read Romans 4 yourself and verify each statement against the verses in your Bible version.\n\nGospel truth\nThe text of Romans 4 records or illustrates: Gospel truth. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states.\n\nLife in the Spirit\nThe text of Romans 4 records or illustrates: Life in the Spirit. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states.\n\nPractical ethics\nThe text of Romans 4 records or illustrates: Practical ethics. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states.\n\nWhat God wants us to know:\nGod wants believers to know gospel truth and how it should shape church life, holiness, and love for others.\n\nWhy:\nPaul''s letters argue from what Christ has done to how Christians should live. Find the doctrinal statement in this chapter and the conduct it connects to.\n\nSimilar elsewhere:\nRomans 3: Compare with Romans 3, which immediately precedes this chapter in the same book — notice what events or themes continue or change.","commentary_af":"Vandag se tematiese leeswerk: Abraham Geregtig Deur Geloof. Bestudeer elke hoofstuk-afdeling hieronder terwyl jy lees.\n\nRomeine 4\nRomeine 4. Paulus leer leerstelling en Christelike lewe. Verbind teologiese waarheid met praktiese gehoorsaamheid in kerk, gesin en daaglikse verhoudings. Lees Romeine 4 self en kontroleer elke stelling teen die verse in jou Bybelweergawe.\n\nEvangelie-waarheid\nDie teks van Romeine 4 noem of illustreer: Evangelie-waarheid. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie.\n\nLewe in die Gees\nDie teks van Romeine 4 noem of illustreer: Lewe in die Gees. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie.\n\nPraktiese etiek\nDie teks van Romeine 4 noem of illustreer: Praktiese etiek. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie.\n\nWhat God wants us to know:\nGod wil gelowiges laat weet evangelie-waarheid en hoe dit kerklewe, heiligheid en liefde moet vorm.\n\nWhy:\nPaulus redeneer van wat Christus gedoen het na hoe Christene moet leef. Soek die leerstelling in hierdie hoofstuk en die lewe wat dit verbind.\n\nSimilar elsewhere:\nRomeine 3: Compare with Romeine 3, wat direct voor hierdie hoofstuk kom — let op wat voortgaan of verander.","questions_en":["What does this passage reveal about God?","What promise, command, or truth stands out to you?","How can you apply this to your life today?"],"questions_af":["Wat openbaar hierdie gedeelte oor God?","Watter belofte, gebod of waarheid val vir jou op?","Hoe kan jy dit vandag in jou lewe toepas?"]},{"day":8,"title_en":"No Condemnation","title_af":"Geen Verdoemenis","passages":[{"book_id":45,"chapter":8}],"commentary_intro_en":"Today''s themed reading: No Condemnation. Study each chapter section below as you read.","commentary_intro_af":"Vandag se tematiese leeswerk: Geen Verdoemenis. Bestudeer elke hoofstuk-afdeling hieronder terwyl jy lees.","commentary_sections":[{"book_id":45,"chapter":8,"heading_en":"Romans 8","heading_af":"Romeine 8","summary_en":"No condemnation for those in Christ. Life in the Spirit vs. flesh. All things work together; nothing separates from God''s love. Read Romans 8 yourself and verify each statement against the verses in your Bible version.","summary_af":"Geen veroordeling vir die wat in Christus is. Lewe in die Gees vs. vlees. Alles werk saam; niks skei van God se liefde. Lees Romeine 8 self en kontroleer elke stelling teen die verse in jou Bybelweergawe.","study_points_en":[{"title":"No condemnation in Christ","verses":"","detail":"The text of Romans 8 records or illustrates: No condemnation in Christ. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."},{"title":"Spirit gives life","verses":"","detail":"The text of Romans 8 records or illustrates: Spirit gives life. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."},{"title":"Nothing can separate us from love","verses":"","detail":"The text of Romans 8 records or illustrates: Nothing can separate us from love. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."}],"study_points_af":[{"title":"Geen veroordeling in Christus","verses":"","detail":"Die teks van Romeine 8 noem of illustreer: Geen veroordeling in Christus. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie."},{"title":"Gees gee lewe","verses":"","detail":"Die teks van Romeine 8 noem of illustreer: Gees gee lewe. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie."},{"title":"Niks kan ons van liefde skei","verses":"","detail":"Die teks van Romeine 8 noem of illustreer: Niks kan ons van liefde skei. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie."}],"teaching_en":"God wants believers to know gospel truth and how it should shape church life, holiness, and love for others.","teaching_why_en":"Paul''s letters argue from what Christ has done to how Christians should live. Find the doctrinal statement in this chapter and the conduct it connects to.","teaching_af":"God wil gelowiges laat weet evangelie-waarheid en hoe dit kerklewe, heiligheid en liefde moet vorm.","teaching_why_af":"Paulus redeneer van wat Christus gedoen het na hoe Christene moet leef. Soek die leerstelling in hierdie hoofstuk en die lewe wat dit verbind.","cross_references_en":[{"ref":"Romans 8:1","comparison":"Romans 8:1 states there is no condemnation for those in Christ Jesus. Romans 8:2–4 contrasts life in the Spirit with the law of sin and death — continuing the same argument in one chapter."},{"ref":"John 5:24","comparison":"Romans 8:1 speaks of no condemnation for those in Christ. John 5:24 records Jesus saying whoever hears and believes has eternal life and does not come into judgment — similar no-condemnation language."}],"cross_references_af":[{"ref":"Romeine 8:1","comparison":"Romeine 8:1 sê daar is geen veroordeling vir die wat in Christus Jesus is nie. Romeine 8:2–4 kontrasteer lewe in die Gees met die wet van sonde en dood."},{"ref":"Johannes 5:24","comparison":"Romeine 8:1 spreek van geen veroordeling vir die in Christus nie. Johannes 5:24 beskryf Jesus wat sê wie hoor en glo het ewige lewe en nie in veroordeling kom nie."}],"highlights_en":["No condemnation in Christ","Spirit gives life","Nothing can separate us from love"],"highlights_af":["Geen veroordeling in Christus","Gees gee lewe","Niks kan ons van liefde skei"]}],"commentary_en":"Today''s themed reading: No Condemnation. Study each chapter section below as you read.\n\nRomans 8\nNo condemnation for those in Christ. Life in the Spirit vs. flesh. All things work together; nothing separates from God''s love. Read Romans 8 yourself and verify each statement against the verses in your Bible version.\n\nNo condemnation in Christ\nThe text of Romans 8 records or illustrates: No condemnation in Christ. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states.\n\nSpirit gives life\nThe text of Romans 8 records or illustrates: Spirit gives life. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states.\n\nNothing can separate us from love\nThe text of Romans 8 records or illustrates: Nothing can separate us from love. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states.\n\nWhat God wants us to know:\nGod wants believers to know gospel truth and how it should shape church life, holiness, and love for others.\n\nWhy:\nPaul''s letters argue from what Christ has done to how Christians should live. Find the doctrinal statement in this chapter and the conduct it connects to.\n\nSimilar elsewhere:\nRomans 8:1: Romans 8:1 states there is no condemnation for those in Christ Jesus. Romans 8:2–4 contrasts life in the Spirit with the law of sin and death — continuing the same argument in one chapter.\nJohn 5:24: Romans 8:1 speaks of no condemnation for those in Christ. John 5:24 records Jesus saying whoever hears and believes has eternal life and does not come into judgment — similar no-condemnation language.","commentary_af":"Vandag se tematiese leeswerk: Geen Verdoemenis. Bestudeer elke hoofstuk-afdeling hieronder terwyl jy lees.\n\nRomeine 8\nGeen veroordeling vir die wat in Christus is. Lewe in die Gees vs. vlees. Alles werk saam; niks skei van God se liefde. Lees Romeine 8 self en kontroleer elke stelling teen die verse in jou Bybelweergawe.\n\nGeen veroordeling in Christus\nDie teks van Romeine 8 noem of illustreer: Geen veroordeling in Christus. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie.\n\nGees gee lewe\nDie teks van Romeine 8 noem of illustreer: Gees gee lewe. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie.\n\nNiks kan ons van liefde skei\nDie teks van Romeine 8 noem of illustreer: Niks kan ons van liefde skei. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie.\n\nWhat God wants us to know:\nGod wil gelowiges laat weet evangelie-waarheid en hoe dit kerklewe, heiligheid en liefde moet vorm.\n\nWhy:\nPaulus redeneer van wat Christus gedoen het na hoe Christene moet leef. Soek die leerstelling in hierdie hoofstuk en die lewe wat dit verbind.\n\nSimilar elsewhere:\nRomeine 8:1: Romeine 8:1 sê daar is geen veroordeling vir die wat in Christus Jesus is nie. Romeine 8:2–4 kontrasteer lewe in die Gees met die wet van sonde en dood.\nJohannes 5:24: Romeine 8:1 spreek van geen veroordeling vir die in Christus nie. Johannes 5:24 beskryf Jesus wat sê wie hoor en glo het ewige lewe en nie in veroordeling kom nie.","questions_en":["What does this passage reveal about God?","What promise, command, or truth stands out to you?","How can you apply this to your life today?"],"questions_af":["Wat openbaar hierdie gedeelte oor God?","Watter belofte, gebod of waarheid val vir jou op?","Hoe kan jy dit vandag in jou lewe toepas?"]},{"day":9,"title_en":"Living Hope","title_af":"Lewende Hoop","passages":[{"book_id":60,"chapter":1}],"commentary_intro_en":"Today''s themed reading: Livin