Compare with Book 55 3, wat direct voor hierdie hoofstuk kom — let op wat voortgaan of verander.","questions_en":["What does this passage reveal about God?","What promise, command, or truth stands out to you?","How can you apply this to your life today?"],"questions_af":["Wat openbaar hierdie gedeelte oor God?","Watter belofte, gebod of waarheid val vir jou op?","Hoe kan jy dit vandag in jou lewe toepas?"]},{"day":20,"title_en":"Hold Fast to Hope","title_af":"Vas Hou aan Hoop","passages":[{"book_id":58,"chapter":6}],"commentary_intro_en":"Today''s themed reading: Hold Fast to Hope. Study each chapter section below as you read.","commentary_intro_af":"Vandag se tematiese leeswerk: Vas Hou aan Hoop. Bestudeer elke hoofstuk-afdeling hieronder terwyl jy lees.","commentary_sections":[{"book_id":58,"chapter":6,"heading_en":"Book 58 6","heading_af":"Boek 58 6","summary_en":"Book 58 6. Pastoral encouragement for faith under pressure. Look for calls to endurance, love, holiness, and confident hope in Christ. Read Book 58 6 yourself and verify each statement against the verses in your Bible version.","summary_af":"Boek 58 6. Pastorale bemoediging vir geloof onder druk. Soek oproepe tot volharding, liefde, heiligheid en versekerde hoop in Christus. Lees Boek 58 6 self en kontroleer elke stelling teen die verse in jou Bybelweergawe.","study_points_en":[{"title":"Endurance in trials","verses":"","detail":"The text of Book 58 6 records or illustrates: Endurance in trials. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."},{"title":"Love and unity","verses":"","detail":"The text of Book 58 6 records or illustrates: Love and unity. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."},{"title":"Hope in Christ''s return","verses":"","detail":"The text of Book 58 6 records or illustrates: Hope in Christ''s return. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."}],"study_points_af":[{"title":"Volharding in beproewing","verses":"","detail":"Die teks van Boek 58 6 noem of illustreer: Volharding in beproewing. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie."},{"title":"Liefde en eenheid","verses":"","detail":"Die teks van Boek 58 6 noem of illustreer: Liefde en eenheid. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie."},{"title":"Hoop in Christus se wederkoms","verses":"","detail":"Die teks van Boek 58 6 noem of illustreer: Hoop in Christus se wederkoms. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie."}],"teaching_en":"God wants his people to remain faithful under pressure, love one another, and hold to hope in Christ.","teaching_why_en":"These letters encourage endurance and holy living. Notice exhortations in this chapter and the reason the writer gives for obeying them.","teaching_af":"God wil sy volk laat bly volhard onder druk, mekaar liefhê, en hoop in Christus hou.","teaching_why_af":"Hierdie briewe moedig volharding en heilige lewe aan. Let op aansporings in hierdie hoofstuk en die rede wat die skrywer gee.","cross_references_en":[{"ref":"Book 58 5","comparison":"Compare with Book 58 5, which immediately precedes this chapter in the same book — notice what events or themes continue or change."}],"cross_references_af":[{"ref":"Book 58 5","comparison":"Compare with Book 58 5, wat direct voor hierdie hoofstuk kom — let op wat voortgaan of verander."}],"highlights_en":["Endurance in trials","Love and unity","Hope in Christ''s return"],"highlights_af":["Volharding in beproewing","Liefde en eenheid","Hoop in Christus se wederkoms"]}],"commentary_en":"Today''s themed reading: Hold Fast to Hope. Study each chapter section below as you read.\n\nBook 58 6\nBook 58 6. Pastoral encouragement for faith under pressure. Look for calls to endurance, love, holiness, and confident hope in Christ. Read Book 58 6 yourself and verify each statement against the verses in your Bible version.\n\nEndurance in trials\nThe text of Book 58 6 records or illustrates: Endurance in trials. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states.\n\nLove and unity\nThe text of Book 58 6 records or illustrates: Love and unity. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states.\n\nHope in Christ''s return\nThe text of Book 58 6 records or illustrates: Hope in Christ''s return. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states.\n\nWhat God wants us to know:\nGod wants his people to remain faithful under pressure, love one another, and hold to hope in Christ.\n\nWhy:\nThese letters encourage endurance and holy living. Notice exhortations in this chapter and the reason the writer gives for obeying them.\n\nSimilar elsewhere:\nBook 58 5: Compare with Book 58 5, which immediately precedes this chapter in the same book — notice what events or themes continue or change.","commentary_af":"Vandag se tematiese leeswerk: Vas Hou aan Hoop. Bestudeer elke hoofstuk-afdeling hieronder terwyl jy lees.\n\nBoek 58 6\nBoek 58 6. Pastorale bemoediging vir geloof onder druk. Soek oproepe tot volharding, liefde, heiligheid en versekerde hoop in Christus. Lees Boek 58 6 self en kontroleer elke stelling teen die verse in jou Bybelweergawe.\n\nVolharding in beproewing\nDie teks van Boek 58 6 noem of illustreer: Volharding in beproewing. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie.\n\nLiefde en eenheid\nDie teks van Boek 58 6 noem of illustreer: Liefde en eenheid. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie.\n\nHoop in Christus se wederkoms\nDie teks van Boek 58 6 noem of illustreer: Hoop in Christus se wederkoms. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie.\n\nWhat God wants us to know:\nGod wil sy volk laat bly volhard onder druk, mekaar liefhê, en hoop in Christus hou.\n\nWhy:\nHierdie briewe moedig volharding en heilige lewe aan. Let op aansporings in hierdie hoofstuk en die rede wat die skrywer gee.\n\nSimilar elsewhere:\nBook 58 5: Compare with Book 58 5, wat direct voor hierdie hoofstuk kom — let op wat voortgaan of verander.","questions_en":["What does this passage reveal about God?","What promise, command, or truth stands out to you?","How can you apply this to your life today?"],"questions_af":["Wat openbaar hierdie gedeelte oor God?","Watter belofte, gebod of waarheid val vir jou op?","Hoe kan jy dit vandag in jou lewe toepas?"]},{"day":21,"title_en":"New Heaven and Earth","title_af":"Nuwe Hemel en Aarde","passages":[{"book_id":66,"chapter":21}],"commentary_intro_en":"Today''s themed reading: New Heaven and Earth. Study each chapter section below as you read.","commentary_intro_af":"Vandag se tematiese leeswerk: Nuwe Hemel en Aarde. Bestudeer elke hoofstuk-afdeling hieronder terwyl jy lees.","commentary_sections":[{"book_id":66,"chapter":21,"heading_en":"Revelation 21","heading_af":"Openbaring 21","summary_en":"Revelation 21. Apocalyptic vision of Christ''s victory and final renewal. Balance symbolic imagery with the certainty that God wins and His people inherit eternal life. Read Revelation 21 yourself and verify each statement against the verses in your Bible version.","summary_af":"Openbaring 21. Apokaliptiese visie van Christus se oorwinning en finale vernuwing. Balanseer simboliese beelde met die sekerheid dat God wen en Sy volk erf ewige lewe. Lees Openbaring 21 self en kontroleer elke stelling teen die verse in jou Bybelweergawe.","study_points_en":[{"title":"Christ the victorious Lamb","verses":"","detail":"The text of Revelation 21 records or illustrates: Christ the victorious Lamb. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."},{"title":"Judgment and mercy","verses":"","detail":"The text of Revelation 21 records or illustrates: Judgment and mercy. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."},{"title":"New creation hope","verses":"","detail":"The text of Revelation 21 records or illustrates: New creation hope. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."}],"study_points_af":[{"title":"Christus die oorwinnaar-Lam","verses":"","detail":"Die teks van Openbaring 21 noem of illustreer: Christus die oorwinnaar-Lam. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie."},{"title":"Vonnis en barmhartigheid","verses":"","detail":"Die teks van Openbaring 21 noem of illustreer: Vonnis en barmhartigheid. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie."},{"title":"Nuwe-skepping hoop","verses":"","detail":"Die teks van Openbaring 21 noem of illustreer: Nuwe-skepping hoop. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie."}],"teaching_en":"God wants us to know that Christ reigns, justice will be done, and God will renew creation for his people.","teaching_why_en":"Revelation uses visions of throne, Lamb, judgment, and new creation. Identify what this chapter records about Christ''s authority and the future God promises.","teaching_af":"God wil hê ons moet weet dat Christus regeer, geregtigheid geskied, en God die skepping vir sy volk sal vernuwe.","teaching_why_af":"Openbaring gebruik visies van troon, Lam, vonnis en nuwe skepping. Identifiseer wat hierdie hoofstuk oor Christus se gesag en die toekoms rekord.","cross_references_en":[{"ref":"Book 66 20","comparison":"Compare with Book 66 20, which immediately precedes this chapter in the same book — notice what events or themes continue or change."}],"cross_references_af":[{"ref":"Book 66 20","comparison":"Compare with Book 66 20, wat direct voor hierdie hoofstuk kom — let op wat voortgaan of verander."}],"highlights_en":["Christ the victorious Lamb","Judgment and mercy","New creation hope"],"highlights_af":["Christus die oorwinnaar-Lam","Vonnis en barmhartigheid","Nuwe-skepping hoop"]}],"commentary_en":"Today''s themed reading: New Heaven and Earth. Study each chapter section below as you read.\n\nRevelation 21\nRevelation 21. Apocalyptic vision of Christ''s victory and final renewal. Balance symbolic imagery with the certainty that God wins and His people inherit eternal life. Read Revelation 21 yourself and verify each statement against the verses in your Bible version.\n\nChrist the victorious Lamb\nThe text of Revelation 21 records or illustrates: Christ the victorious Lamb. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states.\n\nJudgment and mercy\nThe text of Revelation 21 records or illustrates: Judgment and mercy. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states.\n\nNew creation hope\nThe text of Revelation 21 records or illustrates: New creation hope. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states.\n\nWhat God wants us to know:\nGod wants us to know that Christ reigns, justice will be done, and God will renew creation for his people.\n\nWhy:\nRevelation uses visions of throne, Lamb, judgment, and new creation. Identify what this chapter records about Christ''s authority and the future God promises.\n\nSimilar elsewhere:\nBook 66 20: Compare with Book 66 20, which immediately precedes this chapter in the same book — notice what events or themes continue or change.","commentary_af":"Vandag se tematiese leeswerk: Nuwe Hemel en Aarde. Bestudeer elke hoofstuk-afdeling hieronder terwyl jy lees.\n\nOpenbaring 21\nOpenbaring 21. Apokaliptiese visie van Christus se oorwinning en finale vernuwing. Balanseer simboliese beelde met die sekerheid dat God wen en Sy volk erf ewige lewe. Lees Openbaring 21 self en kontroleer elke stelling teen die verse in jou Bybelweergawe.\n\nChristus die oorwinnaar-Lam\nDie teks van Openbaring 21 noem of illustreer: Christus die oorwinnaar-Lam. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie.\n\nVonnis en barmhartigheid\nDie teks van Openbaring 21 noem of illustreer: Vonnis en barmhartigheid. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie.\n\nNuwe-skepping hoop\nDie teks van Openbaring 21 noem of illustreer: Nuwe-skepping hoop. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie.\n\nWhat God wants us to know:\nGod wil hê ons moet weet dat Christus regeer, geregtigheid geskied, en God die skepping vir sy volk sal vernuwe.\n\nWhy:\nOpenbaring gebruik visies van troon, Lam, vonnis en nuwe skepping. Identifiseer wat hierdie hoofstuk oor Christus se gesag en die toekoms rekord.\n\nSimilar elsewhere:\nBook 66 20: Compare with Book 66 20, wat direct voor hierdie hoofstuk kom — let op wat voortgaan of verander.","questions_en":["What does this passage reveal about God?","What promise, command, or truth stands out to you?","How can you apply this to your life today?"],"questions_af":["Wat openbaar hierdie gedeelte oor God?","Watter belofte, gebod of waarheid val vir jou op?","Hoe kan jy dit vandag in jou lewe toepas?"]}]'::jsonb,
