jy dink nie.\n\nKoninkryk-lering\nDie teks van Lukas 10 noem of illustreer: Koninkryk-lering. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie.\n\nOproepe om te volg\nDie teks van Lukas 10 noem of illustreer: Oproepe om te volg. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie.\n\nWhat God wants us to know:\nGod wil hê ons moet weet wie Jesus is en wat Hy mense roep om te glo en te doen deur sy woorde, dade en gesag.\n\nWhy:\nEvangelie-hoofstukke beskryf wat Jesus geleer, genees, beveel of openbaar het. Fokus op wat die hoofstuk sê Jesus gedoen en gesê het.\n\nSimilar elsewhere:\nBook 42 9: Compare with Book 42 9, wat direct voor hierdie hoofstuk kom — let op wat voortgaan of verander.\nParallelle Evangelies: Baie gebeure in Matteus, Markus, Lukas en Johannes verskyn in meer as een Evangelie. Vergelyk dieselfde episode oor Evangelies heen.","questions_en":["What does this passage reveal about God?","What promise, command, or truth stands out to you?","How can you apply this to your life today?"],"questions_af":["Wat openbaar hierdie gedeelte oor God?","Watter belofte, gebod of waarheid val vir jou op?","Hoe kan jy dit vandag in jou lewe toepas?"]},{"day":21,"title_en":"Jesus Feeds Five Thousand","title_af":"Jesus Voed Vyf Duisend","passages":[{"book_id":43,"chapter":6}],"commentary_intro_en":"Family devotion reading. Read each summary together, then discuss what you learn about God.","commentary_intro_af":"Gesins toewyding leeswerk. Lees elke opsomming saam, bespreek dan wat julle oor God leer.","commentary_sections":[{"book_id":43,"chapter":6,"heading_en":"John 6","heading_af":"Johannes 6","summary_en":"John 6. The Gospels reveal Jesus — His teaching, authority, compassion, and mission. Ask: Who is Jesus here, and what is He calling me to believe and do? Read John 6 yourself and verify each statement against the verses in your Bible version.","summary_af":"Johannes 6. Die Evangelies openbaar Jesus 