nd teologiese waarheid met praktiese gehoorsaamheid in kerk, gesin en daaglikse verhoudings. Lees Boek 49 6 self en kontroleer elke stelling teen die verse in jou Bybelweergawe.\n\nEvangelie-waarheid\nDie teks van Boek 49 6 noem of illustreer: Evangelie-waarheid. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie.\n\nLewe in die Gees\nDie teks van Boek 49 6 noem of illustreer: Lewe in die Gees. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie.\n\nPraktiese etiek\nDie teks van Boek 49 6 noem of illustreer: Praktiese etiek. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie.\n\nWhat God wants us to know:\nGod wil gelowiges laat weet evangelie-waarheid en hoe dit kerklewe, heiligheid en liefde moet vorm.\n\nWhy:\nPaulus redeneer van wat Christus gedoen het na hoe Christene moet leef. Soek die leerstelling in hierdie hoofstuk en die lewe wat dit verbind.\n\nSimilar elsewhere:\nBook 49 5: Compare with Book 49 5, wat direct voor hierdie hoofstuk kom — let op wat voortgaan of verander.","questions_en":["What does this passage reveal about God?","What promise, command, or truth stands out to you?","How can you apply this to your life today?"],"questions_af":["Wat openbaar hierdie gedeelte oor God?","Watter belofte, gebod of waarheid val vir jou op?","Hoe kan jy dit vandag in jou lewe toepas?"]},{"day":31,"title_en":"Ruth''s Loyalty","title_af":"Rut Se Getrouheid","passages":[{"book_id":8,"chapter":1}],"commentary_intro_en":"Family devotion reading. Read each summary together, then discuss what you learn about God.","commentary_intro_af":"Gesins toewyding leeswerk. Lees elke opsomming saam, bespreek dan wat julle oor God leer.","commentary_sections":[{"book_id":8,"chapter":1,"heading_en":"Book 8 1","heading_af":"Boek 8 1","summary_en":"Book 8 1. Historical narrative showing God''s guidance through victory, failure, and restoration. Notice leadership, prayer, and the consequences of turning from God. Read Book 8 1 yourself and verify each statement against the verses in your Bible version.","summary_af":"Boek 8 1. Geskiedenisverhaal wat God se leiding wys deur oorwinning, mislukking en herstel. Let op leierskap, gebed en die gevolge van wegdraai van God. Lees Boek 8 1 self en kontroleer elke stelling teen die verse in jou Bybelweergawe.","study_points_en":[{"title":"God''s sovereignty in history","verses":"","detail":"The text of Book 8 1 records or illustrates: God''s sovereignty in history. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."},{"title":"Faithful vs. unfaithful leaders","verses":"","detail":"The text of Book 8 1 records or illustrates: Faithful vs. unfaithful leaders. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."},{"title":"Repentance and restoration","verses":"","detail":"The text of Book 8 1 records or illustrates: Repentance and restoration. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."}],"study_points_af":[{"title":"God se soewereiniteit in geskiedenis","verses":"","detail":"Die teks van Boek 8 1 noem of illustreer: God se soewereiniteit in geskiedenis. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie."},{"title":"Getroue vs. ontroue leiers","verses":"","detail":"Die teks van Boek 8 1 noem of illustreer: Getroue vs. ontroue leiers. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie."},{"title":"Berou en herstel","verses":"","detail":"Die teks van Boek 8 1 noem of illustreer: Berou en herstel. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie."}],"teaching_en":"God wants us to see that he works through history—using leaders, correcting rebellion, and keeping his promises across generations.","teaching_why_en":"Historical books record outcomes when people follow or abandon God''s command. Notice who leads, what they do, and what the chapter says happened as a result.","teaching_af":"