"Family devotion reading. Read each summary together, then discuss what you learn about God.","commentary_intro_af":"Gesins toewyding leeswerk. Lees elke opsomming saam, bespreek dan wat julle oor God leer.","commentary_sections":[{"book_id":27,"chapter":3,"heading_en":"Book 27 3","heading_af":"Boek 27 3","summary_en":"Book 27 3. Prophetic word calling God''s people to covenant faithfulness. Listen for judgment, hope, and promises pointing to Messiah and restoration. Read Book 27 3 yourself and verify each statement against the verses in your Bible version.","summary_af":"Boek 27 3. Profetiese woord wat God se volk roep tot verbondstrousheid. Luister vir vonnis, hoop en beloftes wat wys na Messias en herstel. Lees Boek 27 3 self en kontroleer elke stelling teen die verse in jou Bybelweergawe.","study_points_en":[{"title":"Sin and repentance","verses":"","detail":"The text of Book 27 3 records or illustrates: Sin and repentance. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."},{"title":"God''s holy standards","verses":"","detail":"The text of Book 27 3 records or illustrates: God''s holy standards. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."},{"title":"Hope for the future","verses":"","detail":"The text of Book 27 3 records or illustrates: Hope for the future. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."}],"study_points_af":[{"title":"Sonde en berou","verses":"","detail":"Die teks van Boek 27 3 noem of illustreer: Sonde en berou. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie."},{"title":"God se heilige standaarde","verses":"","detail":"Die teks van Boek 27 3 noem of illustreer: God se heilige standaarde. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie."},{"title":"Hoop vir die toekoms","verses":"","detail":"Die teks van Boek 27 3 noem of illustreer: Hoop vir die toekoms. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie."}],"teaching_en":"God wants his people to know that he calls them back to faithfulness, warns of judgment, and often pairs correction with hope.","teaching_why_en":"Prophetic chapters usually contain God''s speech—accusation, command, or promise. Identify what God says he will do and what he asks his people to do.","teaching_af":"God wil sy volk laat weet dat Hy hulle terugroep na trou, waarsku vir vonnis, en korreksie dikwels met hoop paar.","teaching_why_af":"Profetiese hoofstukke bevat gewoonlik God se spraak—beskuldiging, gebod of belofte. Identifiseer wat God sê Hy sal doen en wat Hy van sy volk vra.","cross_references_en":[{"ref":"Book 27 2","comparison":"Compare with Book 27 2, which immediately precedes this chapter in the same book — notice what events or themes continue or change."}],"cross_references_af":[{"ref":"Book 27 2","comparison":"Compare with Book 27 2, wat direct voor hierdie hoofstuk kom — let op wat voortgaan of verander."}],"highlights_en":["Sin and repentance","God''s holy standards","Hope for the future"],"highlights_af":["Sonde en berou","God se heilige standaarde","Hoop vir die toekoms"]}],"commentary_en":"Family devotion reading. Read each summary together, then discuss what you learn about God.\n\nBook 27 3\nBook 27 3. Prophetic word calling God''s people to covenant faithfulness. Listen for judgment, hope, and promises pointing to Messiah and restoration. Read Book 27 3 yourself and verify each statement against the verses in your Bible version.\n\nSin and repentance\nThe text of Book 27 3 records or illustrates: Sin and repentance. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states.\n\nGod''s holy standards\nThe text of Book 27 3 records or illustrates: God''s holy standards. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states.\n\nHope for the future\nThe text of Book 27 3 records or illustrates: Hope for the future. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states.\n\nWhat God wants us to know:\nGod wants his people to know that he calls them back to faithfulness, warns of judgment, and often pairs correction with hope.\n\nWhy:\nProphetic chapters usually contain God''s speech—accusation, command, or promise. Identify what God says he will do and what he asks his people to do.\n\nSimilar elsewhere:\nBook 27 2: Compare with Book 27 2, which immediately precedes this chapter in the same book — notice what events or themes continue or change.","commentary_af":"Gesins toewyding leeswerk. Lees elke opsomming saam, bespreek dan wat julle oor God leer.\n\nBoek 27 3\nBoek 27 3. Profetiese woord wat God se volk roep tot verbondstrousheid. Luister vir vonnis, hoop en beloftes wat wys na Messias en herstel. Lees Boek 27 3 self en kontroleer elke stelling teen die verse in jou Bybelweergawe.\n\nSonde en berou\nDie teks van Boek 27 3 noem of illustreer: Sonde en berou. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie.\n\nGod se heilige standaarde\nDie teks van Boek 27 3 noem of illustreer: God se heilige standaarde. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie.\n\nHoop vir die toekoms\nDie teks van Boek 27 3 noem of illustreer: Hoop vir die toekoms. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie.\n\nWhat God wants us to know:\nGod wil sy volk laat weet dat Hy hulle terugroep na trou, waarsku vir vonnis, en korreksie dikwels met hoop paar.\n\nWhy:\nProfetiese hoofstukke bevat gewoonlik God se spraak—beskuldiging, gebod of belofte. Identifiseer wat God sê Hy sal doen en wat Hy van sy volk vra.\n\nSimilar elsewhere:\nBook 27 2: Compare with Book 27 2, wat direct voor hierdie hoofstuk kom — let op wat voortgaan of verander.","questions_en":["What does this passage reveal about God?","What promise, command, or truth stands out to you?","How can you apply this to your life today?"],"questions_af":["Wat openbaar hierdie gedeelte oor God?","Watter belofte, gebod of waarheid val vir jou op?","Hoe kan jy dit vandag in jou lewe toepas?"]},{"day":34,"title_en":"The Prodigal Son","title_af":"Die Verlore Seun","passages":[{"book_id":42,"chapter":15}],"commentary_intro_en":"Family devotion reading. Read each summary together, then discuss what you learn about God.","commentary_intro_af":"Gesins toewyding leeswerk. Lees elke opsomming saam, bespreek dan wat julle oor God leer.","commentary_sections":[{"book_id":42,"chapter":15,"heading_en":"Luke 15","heading_af":"Lukas 15","summary_en":"Luke 15. The Gospels reveal Jesus — His teaching, authority, compassion, and mission. Ask: Who is Jesus here, and what is He calling me to believe and do? Read Luke 15 yourself and verify each statement against the verses in your Bible version.","summary_af":"Lukas 15. Die Evangelies openbaar Jesus — Sy lering, gesag, barmhartigheid en sending. Vra: Wie is Jesus hier, en wat roep Hy my om te glo en te doen? Lees Lukas 15 self en kontroleer elke stelling teen die verse in jou Bybelweergawe.","study_points_en":[{"title":"Jesus'' identity and authority","verses":"","detail":"The text of Luke 15 records or illustrates: Jesus'' identity and authority. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."},{"title":"Kingdom teaching","verses":"","detail":"The text of Luke 15 records or illustrates: Kingdom teaching. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."},{"title":"Calls to follow","verses":"","detail":"The text of Luke 15 records or illustrates: Calls to follow. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."}],"study_points_af":[{"title":"Jesus se identiteit en gesag","verses":"","detail":"Die teks van Lukas 15 noem of illustreer: Jesus se identiteit en gesag. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie."},{"title":"Koninkryk-lering","verses":"","detail":"Die teks van Lukas 15 noem of illustreer: Koninkryk-lering. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat 