n vervolging. Let hoe die Gees getuienis bemagtig en hoe die kerk reageer.\n\nSimilar elsewhere:\nBook 44 8: Compare with Book 44 8, wat direct voor hierdie hoofstuk kom — let op wat voortgaan of verander.","questions_en":["What does this passage reveal about God?","What promise, command, or truth stands out to you?","How can you apply this to your life today?"],"questions_af":["Wat openbaar hierdie gedeelte oor God?","Watter belofte, gebod of waarheid val vir jou op?","Hoe kan jy dit vandag in jou lewe toepas?"]},{"day":49,"title_en":"Heaven — No More Tears","title_af":"Hemel — Geen Trane Meer","passages":[{"book_id":66,"chapter":21}],"commentary_intro_en":"Family devotion reading. Read each summary together, then discuss what you learn about God.","commentary_intro_af":"Gesins toewyding leeswerk. Lees elke opsomming saam, bespreek dan wat julle oor God leer.","commentary_sections":[{"book_id":66,"chapter":21,"heading_en":"Revelation 21","heading_af":"Openbaring 21","summary_en":"Revelation 21. Apocalyptic vision of Christ''s victory and final renewal. Balance symbolic imagery with the certainty that God wins and His people inherit eternal life. Read Revelation 21 yourself and verify each statement against the verses in your Bible version.","summary_af":"Openbaring 21. Apokaliptiese visie van Christus se oorwinning en finale vernuwing. Balanseer simboliese beelde met die sekerheid dat God wen en Sy volk erf ewige lewe. Lees Openbaring 21 self en kontroleer elke stelling teen die verse in jou Bybelweergawe.","study_points_en":[{"title":"Christ the victorious Lamb","verses":"","detail":"The text of Revelation 21 records or illustrates: Christ the victorious Lamb. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."},{"title":"Judgment and mercy","verses":"","detail":"The text of Revelation 21 records or illustrates: Judgment and mercy. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."},{"title":"New creation hope","verses":"","detail":"The text of Revelation 21 records or illustrates: New creation hope. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."}],"study_points_af":[{"title":"Christus die oorwinnaar-Lam","verses":"","detail":"Die teks van Openbaring 21 noem of illustreer: Christus die oorwinnaar-Lam. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie."},{"title":"Vonnis en barmhartigheid","verses":"","detail":"Die teks van Openbaring 21 noem of illustreer: Vonnis en barmhartigheid. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie."},{"title":"Nuwe-skepping hoop","verses":"","detail":"Die teks van Openbaring 21 noem of illustreer: Nuwe-skepping hoop. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie."}],"teaching_en":"God wants us to know that Christ reigns, justice will be done, and God will renew creation for his people.","teaching_why_en":"Revelation uses visions of throne, Lamb, judgment, and new creation. Identify what this chapter records about Christ''s authority and the future God promises.","teaching_af":"God wil hê ons moet weet dat Christus regeer, geregtigheid geskied, en God die skepping vir sy volk sal vernuwe.","teaching_why_af":"Openbaring gebruik visies van troon, Lam, vonnis en nuwe skepping. Identifiseer wat hierdie hoofstuk oor Christus se gesag en die toekoms rekord.","cross_references_en":[{"ref":"Book 66 20","comparison":"Compare with Book 66 20, which immediately precedes this chapter in the same book — notice what events or themes continue or change."}],"cross_references_af":[{"ref":"Book 66 20","comparison":"Compare with Book 66 20, wat direct voor hierdie hoofstuk kom — let op wat voortgaan of verander."}],"highlights_en":["Christ the victorious Lamb","Judgment and mercy","New creation hope"],"highlights_af":["Christus die oorwinnaar-Lam","Vonnis en barmhartigheid","Nuwe-skepping hoop"]}],"commentary_en":"Family devotion reading. Read each summary together, then discuss what you learn about God.\n\nRevelation 21\nRevelation 21. Apocalyptic vision of Christ''s victory and final renewal. Balance symbolic imagery with the certainty that God wins and His people inherit eternal life. Read Revelation 21 yourself and verify each statement against the verses in your Bible version.\n\nChrist the victorious Lamb\nThe text of Revelation 21 records or illustrates: Christ the victorious Lamb. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states.\n\nJudgment and mercy\nThe text of Revelation 21 records or illustrates: Judgment and mercy. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states.\n\nNew creation hope\nThe text of Revelation 21 records or illustrates: New creation hope. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states.\n\nWhat God wants us to know:\nGod wants us to know that Christ reigns, justice will be done, and God will renew creation for his people.\n\nWhy:\nRevelation uses visions of throne, Lamb, judgment, and new creation. Identify what this chapter records about Christ''s authority and the future God promises.\n\nSimilar elsewhere:\nBook 66 20: Compare with Book 66 20, which immediately precedes this chapter in the same book — notice what events or themes continue or change.","commentary_af":"Gesins toewyding leeswerk. Lees elke opsomming saam, bespreek dan wat julle oor God leer.\n\nOpenbaring 21\nOpenbaring 21. Apokaliptiese visie van Christus se oorwinning en finale vernuwing. Balanseer simboliese beelde met die sekerheid dat God wen en Sy volk erf ewige lewe. Lees Openbaring 21 self en kontroleer elke stelling teen die verse in jou Bybelweergawe.\n\nChristus die oorwinnaar-Lam\nDie teks van Openbaring 21 noem of illustreer: Christus die oorwinnaar-Lam. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie.\n\nVonnis en barmhartigheid\nDie teks van Openbaring 21 noem of illustreer: Vonnis en barmhartigheid. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie.\n\nNuwe-skepping hoop\nDie teks van Openbaring 21 noem of illustreer: Nuwe-skepping hoop. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie.\n\nWhat God wants us to know:\nGod wil hê ons moet weet dat Christus regeer, geregtigheid geskied, en God die skepping vir sy volk sal vernuwe.\n\nWhy:\nOpenbaring gebruik visies van troon, Lam, vonnis en nuwe skepping. Identifiseer wat hierdie hoofstuk oor Christus se gesag en die toekoms rekord.\n\nSimilar elsewhere:\nBook 66 20: Compare with Book 66 20, wat direct voor hierdie hoofstuk kom — let op wat voortgaan of verander.","questions_en":["What does this passage reveal about God?","What promise, command, or truth stands out to you?","How can you apply this to your life today?"],"questions_af":["Wat openbaar hierdie gedeelte oor God?","Watter belofte, gebod of waarheid val vir jou op?","Hoe kan jy dit vandag in jou lewe toepas?"]},{"day":50,"title_en":"Trust in the Lord","title_af":"Vertrou op die Here","passages":[{"book_id":20,"chapter":3}],"commentary_intro_en":"Family devotion reading. Read each summary together, then discuss what you learn about God.","commentary_intro_af":"Gesins toewyding leeswerk. Lees elke opsomming saam, bespreek dan wat julle oor God leer.","commentary_sections":[{"book_id":20,"chapter":3,"heading_en":"Proverbs 3","heading_af":"Spreuke 3","summary_en":"Trust the Lord, not your own understanding; honor with wealth. Read Proverbs 3 yourself and verify each statement against the verses in your Bible version.","summary_af":"Vertrou die Here, nie jou eie insig; eer met rykdom. Lees Spreuke 3 self en kontroleer elke stelling teen die verse in jou Bybelweergawe.","study_points_en":[{"title":"Practical wisdom for daily choices","verses":"","detail":"The text of Proverbs 3 records or illustrates: Practical wisdom for daily choices. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."},{"title":"Fear of the Lord as foundation","verses":"","detail":"The text of Proverbs 3 records or illustrates: Fear of the Lord as foundation. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."},{"title":"One principle to practice today","verses":"","detail":"The text of Proverbs 3 records or illustrates: One principle to practice today. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."}],"study_points_af":[{"title":"Praktiese wysheid vir daaglikse keuses","verses":"","detail":"Die teks van Spreuke 3 noem of illustreer: Praktiese wysheid vir daaglikse keuses. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie."},{"title":"Vrees vir die Here as fondament","verses":"","detail":"Die teks van Spreuke 3 noem of illustreer: Vrees vir die Here as fondament. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie."},{"title":"Een beginsel om vandag te oefen","verses":"","detail":"Die teks van Spreuke 3 noem of illustreer: Een beginsel om vandag te oefen. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie."}],"teaching_en":"God wants us to know that true wisdom begins with reverence for him and shapes daily choices, speech, and worship.","teaching_why_en":"Wisdom passages tie understanding to the fear of the Lord and practical living. Notice commands, prayers, or counsel in this chapter and what attitude toward God they assume.","teaching_af":"God wil hê ons moet weet dat ware wysheid begin met eerbied vir Hom en daaglikse keuses, spraak en aanbidding vorm.","teaching_why_af":"Wysheid verbind insig met die vrees vir die Here. Let op gebooie, gebede of raad in hierdie hoofstuk en watter houding teenoor God dit veronderstel.","cross_references_en":[{"ref":"Book 20 2","comparison":"Compare with Book 20 2, which immediately precedes this chapter in the same book — notice what events or themes continue or change."},{"ref":"Proverbs 1:7","comparison":"Wisdom books often repeat the theme that the fear of the Lord is the beginning of wisdom (Proverbs 1:7). Compare how each psalm or proverb applies that foundation differently."}],"cross_references_af":[{"ref":"Book 20 2","comparison":"Compare with Book 20 2, wat direct voor hierdie hoofstuk kom — let op wat voortgaan of verander."},{"ref":"Spreuke 1:7","comparison":"Wysheidsboeke herhaal dat die vrees vir die Here die begin van wysheid is (Spr 1:7). Vergelyk hoe elke psalm of spreuk dit toepas."}],"highlights_en":["Practical wisdom for daily choices","Fear of the Lord as foundation","One principle to practice today"],"highlights_af":["Praktiese wysheid vir daaglikse keuses","Vrees vir die Here as fondament","Een beginsel om vandag te oefen"]}],"commentary_en":"Family devotion reading. Read each summary together, then discuss what you learn about God.\n\nProverbs 3\nTrust the Lord, not your own understanding; honor with wealth. Read Proverbs 3 yourself and verify each statement against the verses in your Bible version.\n\nPractical wisdom for daily choices\nThe text of Proverbs 3 records or illustrates: Practical wisdom for daily choices. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states.\n\nFear of the Lord as foundation\nThe text of Proverbs 3 records or illustrates: Fear of the Lord as foundation. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states.\n\nOne principle to practice today\nThe text of Proverbs 3 records or illustrates: One principle to practice today. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states.\n\nWhat God wants us to know:\nGod wants us to know that true wisdom begins with reverence for him and shapes daily choices, speech, and worship.\n\nWhy:\nWisdom passages tie understanding to the fear of the Lord and practical living. Notice commands, prayers, or counsel in this chapter and what attitude toward God they assume.\n\nSimilar elsewhere:\nBook 20 2: Compare with Book 20 2, which immediately precedes this chapter in the same book — notice what events or themes continue or change.\nProverbs 1:7: Wisdom books often repeat the theme that the fear of the Lord is the beginning of wisdom (Proverbs 1:7). Compare how each psalm or proverb applies that foundation differently.","commentary_af":"Gesins toewyding leeswerk. Lees elke opsomming saam, bespreek dan wat julle oor God leer.\n\nSpreuke 3\nVertrou die Here, nie jou eie insig; eer met rykdom. Lees Spreuke 3 self en kontroleer elke stelling teen die verse in jou Bybelweergawe.\n\nPraktiese wysheid vir daaglikse keuses\nDie teks van Spreuke 3 noem of illustreer: Praktiese wysheid vir daaglikse keuses. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie.\n\nVrees vir die Here as fondament\nDie teks van Spreuke 3 noem of illustreer: Vrees vir die Here as fondament. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie.\n\nEen beginsel om vandag te oefen\nDie teks van Spreuke 3 noem of illustreer: Een beginsel om vandag te oefen. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie.\n\nWhat God wants us to know:\nGod wil hê ons moet weet dat ware wysheid begin met eerbied vir Hom en daaglikse keuses, spraak en aanbidding vorm.\n\nWhy:\nWysheid verbind insig met die vrees vir die Here. Let op gebooie, gebede of raad in hierdie hoofstuk en watter houding teenoor God dit veronderstel.\n\nSimilar elsewhere:\nBook 20 2: Compare with Book 20 2, wat direct voor hierdie hoofstuk kom — let op wat voortgaan of verander.\nSpreuke 1:7: Wysheidsboeke herhaal dat die vrees vir die Here die begin van wysheid is (Spr 1:7). Vergelyk hoe elke psalm of spreuk dit toepas.","questions_en":["What does this passage reveal about God?","What promise, command, or truth stands out to you?","How can you apply this to your life today?"],"questions_af":["Wat openbaar hierdie gedeelte oor God?","Watter belofte, gebod of waarheid val vir jou op?","Hoe kan jy dit vandag in jou lewe toepas?"]},{"day":51,"title_en":"Give Thanks Always","title_af":"Wees Altyd Dankbaar","passages":[{"book_id":52,"chapter":5}],"commentary_intro_en":"Family devotion reading. Read each summary together, then discuss what you learn about God.","commentary_intro_af":"Gesins toewyding leeswerk. Lees elke opsomming saam, bespreek dan wat julle oor God leer.","commentary_sections":[{"book_id":52,"chapter":5,"heading_en":"Book 52 5","heading_af":"Boek 52 5","summary_en":"Book 52 5. Paul teaches doctrine and Christian living. Connect theological truth to practical obedience in church, family, and daily relationships. Read Book 52 5 yourself and verify each statement against the verses in your Bible version.","summary_af":"Boek 52 5. Paulus leer leerstelling en Christelike lewe. Verbind teologiese waarheid met praktiese gehoorsaamheid in kerk, gesin en daaglikse verhoudings. Lees Boek 52 5 self en kontroleer elke stelling teen die verse in jou Bybelweergawe.","study_points_en":[{"title":"Gospel truth","verses":"","detail":"The text of Book 52 5 records or illustrates: Gospel truth. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."},{"title":"Life in the Spirit","verses":"","detail":"The text of Book 52 5 records or illustrates: Life in the Spirit. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."},{"title":"Practical ethics","verses":"","detail":"The text of Book 52 5 records or illustrates: Practical ethics. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."}],"study_points_af":[{"title":"Evangelie-waarheid","verses":"","detail":"Die teks van Boek 52 5 noem of illustreer: Evangelie-waarheid. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie."},{"title":"Lewe in die Gees","verses":"","detail":"Die teks van Boek 52 5 noem of illustreer: Lewe in die Gees. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie."},{"title":"Praktiese etiek","verses":"","detail":"Die teks van Boek 52 5 noem of illustreer: Praktiese etiek. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie."}],"teaching_en":"God wants believers to know gospel truth and how it should shape church life, holiness, and love for others.","teaching_why_en":"Paul''s letters argue from what Christ has done to how Christians should live. Find the doctrinal statement in this chapter and the conduct it connects to.","teaching_af":"God wil gelowiges laat weet evangelie-waarheid en hoe dit kerklewe, heiligheid en liefde moet vorm.","teaching_why_af":"Paulus redeneer van wat Christus gedoen het na hoe Christene moet leef. Soek die leerstelling in hierdie hoofstuk en die lewe wat dit verbind.","cross_references_en":[{"ref":"Book 52 4","comparison":"Compare with Book 52 4, which immediately precedes this chapter in the same book — notice what events or themes continue or change."}],"cross_references_af":[{"ref":"Book 52 4","comparison":"Compare with Book 52 4, wat direct voor hierdie hoofstuk kom — let op wat voortgaan of verander."}],"highlights_en":["Gospel truth","Life in the Spirit","Practical ethics"],"highlights_af":["Evangelie-waarheid","Lewe in die Gees","Praktiese etiek"]}],"commentary_en":"Family devotion reading. Read each summary together, then discuss what you learn about God.\n\nBook 52 5\nBook 52 5. Paul teaches doctrine and Christian living. Connect theological truth to practical obedience in church, family, and daily relationships. Read Book 52 5 yourself and verify each statement against the verses in your Bible version.\n\nGospel truth\nThe text of Book 52 5 records or illustrates: Gospel truth. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states.\n\nLife in the Spirit\nThe text of Book 52 5 records or illustrates: Life in the Spirit. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states.\n\nPractical ethics\nThe text of Book 52 5 records or illustrates: Practical ethics. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states.\n\nWhat God wants us to know:\nGod wants believers to know gospel truth and how it should shape church life, holiness, and love for others.\n\nWhy:\nPaul''s letters argue from what Christ has done to how Christians should live. Find the doctrinal statement in this chapter and the conduct it connects to.\n\nSimilar elsewhere:\nBook 52 4: Compare with Book 52 4, which immediately precedes this chapter in the same book — notice what events or themes continue or change.","commentary_af":"Gesins toewyding leeswerk. Lees elke opsomming saam, bespreek dan wat julle oor God leer.\n\nBoek 52 5\nBoek 52 5. Paulus leer leerstelling en Christelike lewe. Verbind teologiese waarheid met praktiese gehoorsaamheid in kerk, gesin en daaglikse verhoudings. Lees Boek 52 5 self en kontroleer elke stelling teen die verse in jou Bybelweergawe.\n\nEvangelie-waarheid\nDie teks van Boek 52 5 noem of illustreer: Evangelie-waarheid. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie.\n\nLewe in die Gees\nDie teks van Boek 52 5 noem of illustreer: Lewe in die Gees. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie.\n\nPraktiese etiek\nDie teks van Boek 52 5 noem of illustreer: Praktiese etiek. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie.\n\nWhat God wants us to know:\nGod wil gelowiges laat weet evangelie-waarheid en hoe dit kerklewe, heiligheid en liefde moet vorm.\n\nWhy:\nPaulus redeneer van wat Christus gedoen het na hoe Christene moet leef. Soek die leerstelling in hierdie hoofstuk en die lewe wat dit verbind.\n\nSimilar elsewhere:\nBook 52 4: Compare with Book 52 4, wat direct voor hierdie hoofstuk kom — let op wat voortgaan of verander.","questions_en":["What does this passage reveal about God?","What promise, command, or truth stands out to you?","How can you apply this to your life today?"],"questions_af":["Wat openbaar hierdie gedeelte oor God?","Watter belofte, gebod of waarheid val vir jou op?","Hoe kan jy dit vandag in jou lewe toepas?"]},{"day":52,"title_en":"God Is Love","title_af":"God Is Liefde","passages":[{"book_id":62,"chapter":4}],"commentary_intro_en":"Family devotion reading. Read each summary together, then discuss what you learn about God.","commentary_intro_af":"Gesins toewyding leeswerk. Lees elke opsomming saam, bespreek dan wat julle oor God leer.","commentary_sections":[{"book_id":62,"chapter":4,"heading_en":"Book 62 4","heading_af":"Boek 62 4","summary_en":"Book 62 4. Pastoral encouragement for faith under pressure. Look for calls to endurance, love, holiness, and confident hope in Christ. Read Book 62 4 yourself and verify each statement against the verses in your Bible version.","summary_af":"Boek 62 4. Pastorale bemoediging vir geloof onder druk. Soek oproepe tot volharding, liefde, heiligheid en versekerde hoop in Christus. Lees Boek 62 4 self en kontroleer elke stelling teen die verse in jou Bybelweergawe.","study_points_en":[{"title":"Endurance in trials","verses":"","detail":"The text of Book 62 4 records or illustrates: Endurance in trials. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."},{"title":"Love and unity","verses":"","detail":"The text of Book 62 4 records or illustrates: Love and unity. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."},{"title":"Hope in Christ''s return","verses":"","detail":"The text of Book 62 4 records or illustrates: Hope in Christ''s return. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."}],"study_points_af":[{"title":"Volharding in beproewing","verses":"","detail":"Die teks van Boek 62 4 noem of illustreer: Volharding in beproewing. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie."},{"title":"Liefde en eenheid","verses":"","detail":"Die teks van Boek 62 4 noem of illustreer: Liefde en eenheid. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie."},{"title":"Hoop in Christus se wederkoms","verses":"","detail":"Die teks van Boek 62 4 noem of illustreer: Hoop in Christus se wederkoms. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie."}],"teaching_en":"God wants his people to remain faithful under pressure, love one another, and hold to hope in Christ.","teaching_why_en":"These letters encourage endurance and holy living. Notice exhortations in this chapter and the reason the writer gives for obeying them.","teaching_af":"God wil sy volk laat bly volhard onder druk, mekaar liefhê, en hoop in Christus hou.","teaching_why_af":"Hierdie briewe moedig volharding en heilige lewe aan. Let op aansporings in hierdie hoofstuk en die rede wat die skrywer gee.","cross_references_en":[{"ref":"Book 62 3","comparison":"Compare with Book 62 3, which immediately precedes this chapter in the same book — notice what events or themes continue or change."}],"cross_references_af":[{"ref":"Book 62 3","comparison":"Compare with Book 62 3, wat direct voor hierdie hoofstuk kom — let op wat voortgaan of verander."}],"highlights_en":["Endurance in trials","Love and unity","Hope in Christ''s return"],"highlights_af":["Volharding in beproewing","Liefde en eenheid","Hoop in Christus se wederkoms"]}],"commentary_en":"Family devotion reading. Read each summary together, then discuss what you learn about God.\n\nBook 62 4\nBook 62 4. Pastoral encouragement for faith under pressure. Look for calls to endurance, love, holiness, and confident hope in Christ. Read Book 62 4 yourself and verify each statement against the verses in your Bible version.\n\nEndurance in trials\nThe text of Book 62 4 records or illustrates: Endurance in trials. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states.\n\nLove and unity\nThe text of Book 62 4 records or illustrates: Love and unity. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states.\n\nHope in Christ''s return\nThe text of Book 62 4 records or illustrates: Hope in Christ''s return. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states.\n\nWhat God wants us to know:\nGod wants his people to remain faithful under pressure, love one another, and hold to hope in Christ.\n\nWhy:\nThese letters encourage endurance and holy living. Notice exhortations in this chapter and the reason the writer gives for obeying them.\n\nSimilar elsewhere:\nBook 62 3: Compare with Book 62 3, which immediately precedes this chapter in the same book — notice what events or themes continue or change.","commentary_af":"Gesins toewyding leeswerk. Lees elke opsomming saam, bespreek dan wat julle oor God leer.\n\nBoek 62 4\nBoek 62 4. Pastorale bemoediging vir geloof onder druk. Soek oproepe tot volharding, liefde, heiligheid en versekerde hoop in Christus. Lees Boek 62 4 self en kontroleer elke stelling teen die verse in jou Bybelweergawe.\n\nVolharding in beproewing\nDie teks van Boek 62 4 noem of illustreer: Volharding in beproewing. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie.\n\nLiefde en eenheid\nDie teks van Boek 62 4 noem of illustreer: Liefde en eenheid. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie.\n\nHoop in Christus se wederkoms\nDie teks van Boek 62 4 noem of illustreer: Hoop in Christus se wederkoms. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie.\n\nWhat God wants us to know:\nGod wil sy volk laat bly volhard onder druk, mekaar liefhê, en hoop in Christus hou.\n\nWhy:\nHierdie briewe moedig volharding en heilige lewe aan. Let op aansporings in hierdie hoofstuk en die rede wat die skrywer gee.\n\nSimilar elsewhere:\nBook 62 3: Compare with Book 62 3, wat direct voor hierdie hoofstuk kom — let op wat voortgaan of verander.","questions_en":["What does this passage reveal about God?","What promise, command, or truth stands out to you?","How can you apply this to your life today?"],"questions_af":["Wat openbaar hierdie gedeelte oor God?","Watter belofte, gebod of waarheid val vir jou op?","Hoe kan jy dit vandag in jou lewe toepas?"]}]'::jsonb,
