atteus 25 noem of illustreer: Oproepe om te volg. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie.\n\nWhat God wants us to know:\nGod wil hê ons moet weet wie Jesus is en wat Hy mense roep om te glo en te doen deur sy woorde, dade en gesag.\n\nWhy:\nEvangelie-hoofstukke beskryf wat Jesus geleer, genees, beveel of openbaar het. Fokus op wat die hoofstuk sê Jesus gedoen en gesê het.\n\nSimilar elsewhere:\nBook 40 24: Compare with Book 40 24, wat direct voor hierdie hoofstuk kom — let op wat voortgaan of verander.\nParallelle Evangelies: Baie gebeure in Matteus, Markus, Lukas en Johannes verskyn in meer as een Evangelie. Vergelyk dieselfde episode oor Evangelies heen.","questions_en":["What does this passage reveal about God?","What promise, command, or truth stands out to you?","How can you apply this to your life today?"],"questions_af":["Wat openbaar hierdie gedeelte oor God?","Watter belofte, gebod of waarheid val vir jou op?","Hoe kan jy dit vandag in jou lewe toepas?"]},{"day":17,"title_en":"The Talents","title_af":"Die Talenten","passages":[{"book_id":40,"chapter":25}],"commentary_intro_en":"Today''s themed reading: The Talents. Study each chapter section below as you read.","commentary_intro_af":"Vandag se tematiese leeswerk: Die Talenten. Bestudeer elke hoofstuk-afdeling hieronder terwyl jy lees.","commentary_sections":[{"book_id":40,"chapter":25,"heading_en":"Matthew 25","heading_af":"Matteus 25","summary_en":"Matthew 25. The Gospels reveal Jesus — His teaching, authority, compassion, and mission. Ask: Who is Jesus here, and what is He calling me to believe and do? Read Matthew 25 yourself and verify each statement against the verses in your Bible version.","summary_af":"Matteus 25. Die Evangelies openbaar Jesus — Sy lering, gesag, barmhartigheid en sending. Vra: Wie is Jesus hier, en wat roep Hy my om te glo en te doen? Lees Matteus 25 self en kontroleer elke stelling teen die verse in jou Bybelweergawe.","study_points_en":