 know who Jesus is and what he calls people to believe and do through his words, actions, and authority.\n\nWhy:\nGospel chapters record what Jesus taught, healed, commanded, or revealed about the kingdom. Focus on what the chapter says Jesus did and said—not later tradition.\n\nSimilar elsewhere:\nBook 41 11: Compare with Book 41 11, which immediately precedes this chapter in the same book — notice what events or themes continue or change.\nParallel Gospels: Many events in Matthew, Mark, Luke, and John appear in more than one Gospel with matching or overlapping details. Compare the same episode across Gospels to see what each writer records.","commentary_af":"Vandag se tematiese leeswerk: Wewenaar se Gawe. Bestudeer elke hoofstuk-afdeling hieronder terwyl jy lees.\n\nMarkus 12\nMarkus 12. Die Evangelies openbaar Jesus — Sy lering, gesag, barmhartigheid en sending. Vra: Wie is Jesus hier, en wat roep Hy my om te glo en te doen? Lees Markus 12 self en kontroleer elke stelling teen die verse in jou Bybelweergawe.\n\nJesus se identiteit en gesag\nDie teks van Markus 12 noem of illustreer: Jesus se identiteit en gesag. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie.\n\nKoninkryk-lering\nDie teks van Markus 12 noem of illustreer: Koninkryk-lering. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie.\n\nOproepe om te volg\nDie teks van Markus 12 noem of illustreer: Oproepe om te volg. Lees daardie verse weer en skryf presies op wat die Bybel sê — nie wat jy dink nie.\n\nWhat God wants us to know:\nGod wil hê ons moet weet wie Jesus is en wat Hy mense roep om te glo en te doen deur sy woorde, dade en gesag.\n\nWhy:\nEvangelie-hoofstukke beskryf wat Jesus geleer, genees, beveel of openbaar het. Fokus op wat die hoofstuk sê Jesus gedoen en gesê het.\n\nSimilar elsewhere:\nBook 41 11: Compare with Book 41 11, wat direct voor hierdie hoofstuk kom — let op wat voortgaan of verander.\nParallelle Evangelies: Baie gebeure in Matteus, Markus, Lukas en Johannes verskyn in meer as een Evangelie. Vergelyk dieselfde episode oor Evangelies heen.","questions_en":["What does this passage reveal about God?","What promise, command, or truth stands out to you?","How can you apply this to your life today?"],"questions_af":["Wat openbaar hierdie gedeelte oor God?","Watter belofte, gebod of waarheid val vir jou op?","Hoe kan jy dit vandag in jou lewe toepas?"]},{"day":20,"title_en":"Dorcas — Acts of Kindness","title_af":"Dorkas — Daad van Goedheid","passages":[{"book_id":44,"chapter":9}],"commentary_intro_en":"Today''s themed reading: Dorcas — Acts of Kindness. Study each chapter section below as you read.","commentary_intro_af":"Vandag se tematiese leeswerk: Dorkas — Daad van Goedheid. Bestudeer elke hoofstuk-afdeling hieronder terwyl jy lees.","commentary_sections":[{"book_id":44,"chapter":9,"heading_en":"Acts 9","heading_af":"Handeling 9","summary_en":"Acts 9. The Spirit-empowered spread of the Gospel. Notice courage, community life, prayer, and how the church responds to persecution. Read Acts 9 yourself and verify each statement against the verses in your Bible version.","summary_af":"Handeling 9. Die Gees-bemagtigde verspreiding van die Evangelie. Let op moed, gemeenskaplewe, gebed en hoe die kerk op vervolging reageer. Lees Handeling 9 self en kontroleer elke stelling teen die verse in jou Bybelweergawe.","study_points_en":[{"title":"Holy Spirit''s power","verses":"","detail":"The text of Acts 9 records or illustrates: Holy Spirit''s power. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."},{"title":"Bold witness","verses":"","detail":"The text of Acts 9 records or illustrates: Bold witness. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."},{"title":"Growing community","verses":"","detail":"The text of Acts 9 records or illustrates: Growing community. Re-read those verses and note exactly what Scripture states."}],"study_points_af":[{"title":"Heilige Gees se